url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/dafe7db4f0d3a7b3c0dfe1f385cbb02a6339d0a8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/8910618828d436a1579ccc0320c179da3c7a7f5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T19:02:44Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T19:02:44Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"feat(cassandra-spring-boot): a generated PATCH honours RFC 7386 - in merge-patch+json a key sent as null CLEARS the column\n\nSame change as generator-jhipster-ai-postgresql 3.1.0, for Cassandra: the resource reads the body as sent (JsonNode,\nSpring''s ObjectMapper via inject_template) and, for application/merge-patch+json only, the keys sent as null are cleared\nafter the usual non-null copy - an optional column that is not part of the key (partition / clustering columns never).\napplication/json keeps \"a null is ignored\". A generated switch per entity; partialUpdate(dto, clearedFields) on the\nservice, the one-argument form clears nothing. Reactive apps unchanged.\n\nGenerated tests per entity: mergePatch<E>WithAnExplicitNull_clearsThatField and jsonPatch<E>WithANull_leavesThatField -\nboth send what a caller holds (the whole record) with one field null, so single and composite keys are covered; the\npartial/full PATCH tests that send a whole bean now say application/json.\n\nRED: PostResourceIT (composite key), SaathratriEntity2ResourceIT (multi partition + clustering) and\nAddOnsSelectedByOrganizationResourceIT .mergePatch...WithAnExplicitNull_clearsThatField - \"expected: null\".\nGREEN: those 56/56, sample verify 54 unit + 154 IT, BUILD SUCCESS; npm test 12/12 (the one eslint warning, insertAt in\ncypress/generator.js, is pre-existing).\n\nHarness note: the sample''s FIRST generation into an empty folder still wrote LiquibaseConfiguration + liquibase deps\n(context failed to load: no LiquibaseProperties bean) although .yo-rc.json says databaseMigration=loader; regenerating\nwith that .yo-rc.json present writes none. The real services (cassandrablog, cassandrastore) have none.\n\n.","tree":{"sha":"81e726b629d89bd35234186bdb43867744460b16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/81e726b629d89bd35234186bdb43867744460b16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/8910618828d436a1579ccc0320c179da3c7a7f5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a