"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/631d829807ecf59826881ca5f3fafc3dd508afed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T12:51:05Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T12:51:05Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"fix(cassandra-angular): resetForm disables a user-supplied key when it is PRESENT, like createFormGroup\n\nThe single-key, non-generated branch emitted disabled: !value - inverted - so after resetForm with\nan existing entity the key was editable. The blueprint''s own form-service spec says it is disabled.\n\nRED: cassandrablog ng test - MessageBySid form-service spec, 2 failing (1161/1163).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BnzbQ4yj6s9MULYuohBJq9","tree":{"sha":"c5b24b803e41cd8eae2be2f311c9698db77222f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/c5b24b803e41cd8eae2be2f311c9698db77222f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/631d829807ecf59826881ca5f3fafc3dd508afed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/631d829807ecf59826881ca5f3fafc3dd508afed","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyAINoAKDYzMWQ4Mjk4MDdlY2Y1OTgyNjg4MWNhNWYzZmFmYzNkZDUwOGFmZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/36f0c6283e9184c419c05e1ed0ee03106aa707d0","sha":"36f0c6283e9184c419c05e1ed0ee03106aa707d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/36f0c6283e9184c419c05e1ed0ee03106aa707d0"}],"sha":"631d829807ecf59826881ca5f3fafc3dd508afed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/631d829807ecf59826881ca5f3fafc3dd508afed"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/36f0c6283e9184c419c05e1ed0ee03106aa707d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T05:01:43Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T05:01:43Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"build: generator-jhipster 9.2.0 -> 9.4.0\n\nBreaking changes handled (found by the full Saathratri regen + generated-app builds;\nnpm test only showed snapshot churn):\n- Cassandra now defaults to Liquibase (9.3.1+) and the regen starts from a\n  deleted .yo-rc.json: data-cassandra CONFIGURING pins databaseMigration=loader\n  (this blueprint''s schema model is the CQL changelog + hand-applied patches).\n- CassandraTestContainersSpringContextCustomizerFactory replaced by a\n  ServiceConnection CassandraTestContainer: the Driver-3 getCluster() patch is\n  deleted (editFile failed the generation); TESTING.md 7.1 marked retired.\n- AssertUtils.zonedDataTimeSameInstant -> zonedDateTimeSameInstant (Asserts override).\n- Jackson 2 dropped: ResourceIT uses tools.jackson ObjectMapper; dev yml\n  spring.jackson2 -> spring.jackson.\n- Native Federation: webpack.microfrontend.js patch deleted; remoteEntry\n  cache-bust moved to main.ts (remoteEntry.json?ts=<per-load>).\n- Angular 22 / app restructure in the entity-template overrides:\n  ApplicationConfigService -> serverApiUrl/microserviceContextPath, isPresent\n  removed (inline null filter), UserRouteAccessService -> userRouteAccessService.\n- OnPush is Angular 22''s default: the 15 components that never declared a\n  strategy now declare ChangeDetectionStrategy.Eager (their state is plain\n  fields mutated from subscriptions/dialog callbacks).\n- Navbar patches: null-safe (?? []) grouped dropdowns, dead non-gateway\n  EntityNavbarItems patch removed, sort applies to every microfrontend app.\n- Snapshots updated for upstream file-set churn only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BnzbQ4yj6s9MULYuohBJq9","tree":{"sha":"c0e1f9ec5a83aa05ec09a9a8ede0416109b0d0e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/c0e1f9ec5a83aa05ec09a9a8ede0416109b0d0e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/36f0c6283e9184c419c05e1ed0ee03106aa707d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/36f0c6283e9184c419c05e1ed0ee03106aa707d0","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyAINoAKDM2ZjBjNjI4M2U5MTg0YzQxOWMwNWUxZWQwZWUwMzEwNmFhNzA3ZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/02acd484b6a0a3427781050dd77311f85181480c","sha":"02acd484b6a0a3427781050dd77311f85181480c","url":"https://api.github.co