@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"chore: point GitHub URLs at the saathratri org after repo transfer\n\nThis repository moved from amarpatel-xx to saathratri (the Saathratri, LLC\nGitHub account) on 2026-08-05, so the company owns its own open source rather\nthan it sitting under a personal account.\n\nUpdates package.json repository/bugs/homepage plus the docs that linked to the\nold path. GitHub 301-redirects the old URLs, so nothing was broken meanwhile —\nbut the published npm metadata should say where the code actually lives, which\nmeans this needs a republish to take effect on npmjs.com.\n\nThe bare profile link github.com/amarpatel-xx is deliberately left alone\nwherever it appears: the personal account did not move, only the repositories.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QehTmCnTeGoyp5H7umjKvX","tree":{"sha":"3a3b0028c1ae994ac4128eb94e85ab2017cef141","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/3a3b0028c1ae994ac4128eb94e85ab2017cef141"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/367916a72c33c85271aaad2c837b214eb65e9a3c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_u