nd never\n  installed hooks (upgraded to husky 9.1.7)\n- the lint-staged glob ''{,src/**,webpack/}'' silently skipped generators/**,\n  the directory all blueprint code lives in (now ''{,**/}'' — same coverage as\n  the npm-test workflow''s prettier-check)\n- lint-staged only ran prettier; eslint --fix added so lint errors block the\n  commit too (cassandra repo had no lint-staged config or hook at all)\n\nVerified live: a deliberately misformatted generators/*.js is auto-formatted\nduring commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TsfLhC3Jrki6WmZckNGfSN","tree":{"sha":"636dd3118943911309619e3cf10066c44444eece","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/636dd3118943911309619e3cf10066c44444eece"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/2b60179dfa1cce79dda6296a26eed1b2f44e8ff3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.co