a/commit/b31412d015a40312e5c10fe349c73dd552537997","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyAINoAKGIzMTQxMmQwMTVhNDAzMTJlNWMxMGZlMzQ5YzczZGQ1NTI1Mzc5OTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/504e05043fed574fa98f102f4fef9fbd9bac1040","sha":"504e05043fed574fa98f102f4fef9fbd9bac1040","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/504e05043fed574fa98f102f4fef9fbd9bac1040"}],"sha":"b31412d015a40312e5c10fe349c73dd552537997","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/b31412d015a40312e5c10fe349c73dd552537997"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/504e05043fed574fa98f102f4fef9fbd9bac1040/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T22:57:29Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T22:57:29Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"feat(embeddings): lifecycle tests, .env key supply, fake model, AI e2e; fix update-spec router leak\n\n- test(IT): embedding lifecycle tests in the ResourceIT template — generated on\n  create, regenerated on update and partialUpdate (mocked EmbeddingModel; the\n  patch_template regeneration fix already existed here)\n- feat: OpenAI key can now come from a git-ignored .env file (.env.example\n  templated per vector app; .gitignore gains .env; EmbeddingConfiguration reads\n  it as a fallback after spring.ai.openai.api-key and OPENAI_API_KEY)\n- feat: deterministic fake embedding model (openai.embedding.fake /\n  OPENAI_EMBEDDING_FAKE) for offline dev and e2e; determinism unit test\n- test(e2e): AI-search smoke + embedding-lifecycle cypress specs, injected by a\n  NEW aiSearchE2eEntitiesTemplateTask (separate from\n  postWritingEntitiesTemplateTask so the orchestrator prepare guard doesn''t\n  skip it) — dual-mode: cassandra selectors + DTO vector-value assertions, or\n  SQL data-cy selectors + threshold assertions when assembled into the\n  orchestrator; gated on cy.env fakeEmbeddings (Cypress 15 compatible)\n- fix(spec): update-component specs spied on previousState without mocking it;\n  this blueprint''s previousState() router.navigates (upstream uses\n  history.back()), so the call-through spy leaked unhandled NG04002 errors and\n  failed the vitest exit code despite all tests passing — spy now uses\n  mockImplementation\n- docs: README documents the three key-supply options (with the correct\n  spring.ai.openai.api-key property name) and the fake model\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TsfLhC3Jrki6WmZckNGfSN","tree":{"sha":"b869fa8534652251ee7cf4f0d8ef030f403d7c33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/b869fa8534652251ee7cf4f0d8ef030f403d7c33"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/504e05043fe