":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/3a3ce77828edd76aa2bfb9cb651291c008d5944a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T19:51:52Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T19:51:52Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"fix(deps): exclude legacy swagger-annotations from the openai deps\n\nThe cassandra blueprint adds the same spring-ai-openai / openai-java-client-okhttp\ndeps as the ai-postgresql blueprint, which drag in the legacy\nio.swagger.core.v3:swagger-annotations jar that shadows springdoc''s\nswagger-annotations-jakarta (Schema.$dynamicRef() NoSuchMethodError -> GET\n/v3/api-docs 500). Latent here until a Cassandra entity has vector fields; apply\nthe same exclusion the ai-postgresql blueprint uses for parity.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y9R9UkhexwZYSmM4qUoeA4","tree":{"sha":"df7388690c26297717f83bcc38358c9beb3637c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/df7388690c26297717f83bcc38358c9beb3637c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/3a3ce77828edd76aa2bfb9cb651291c008d5944a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","