amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/41186e1cbc218cf0efab2647b15916ab2b218c66/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T14:38:44Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T14:38:44Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"fix(jhipster-9.1.0): drop `options` from command definitions\n\nJHipster 9.1.0 rejects an `options` key in a JHipsterCommandDefinition:\nbase-core/generator.js#parseCurrentCommand throws \"Options are not supported\nanymore in JHipster commands, please use configs instead\" whenever\n`commandDef.options` is truthy — and the empty `options: {}` stub every\ngenerator shipped is truthy, so it trips too.\n\nThe check is gated on `!skipChecks`, and the vitest harness sets skipChecks,\nso this was invisible to `npm test` and only surfaced during a full regen\n(`jhipster:workspaces#generateApplications` -> the first generator parsed).\n\nRemove the empty `options: {}` from every command.js (configs/arguments/import\nare preserved).\n\nVerified: vitest green; full orchestrator regen now completes successfully.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y9R9UkhexwZYSmM4qUoeA4","tree":{"sha":"eb7cc8dae8c5f6b0d05a1f43152c018977012f7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/eb7cc8dae8c5f6b0d05a1f43152c018977012f7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/41186e1cbc218cf0efab2647b15916ab2b218c66","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"un