ts{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/0ef40778cd98c3f10bc0e5a477c9c4e57cc4c4d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T01:05:38Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T01:05:38Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"docs(TESTING): expand the ALLOW FILTERING caveat into production guidance\n\nSpell out, in §4.2, that the @AllowFiltering partial-partition search is a cross-partition\nscan whose cost scales with the whole table: list when it''s acceptable (bounded/lookup tables,\nlow-QPS admin search, dev) vs not (unbounded hot read paths), and the idiomatic fix — a\npurpose-built denormalized query table keyed on what you search by (SAI as a lighter middle\nground), pointing the progressive-search branch at it. Frame the generated endpoints as a\nworking default + TODO marker, not a finished design, for tables expected to grow.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a767d77714d036effe438768ded65c242cb8790","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/9a767d77714d036effe438768ded65c242cb8790"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/0ef40778cd98c3f10bc0e5a477c9c4e57cc4c4d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/0ef40778cd98c3f10bc0e5a477c9c4e57cc4c4d1","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyAINoAKDBlZjQwNzc4Y2Q5OGMzZjEwYmMwZTVhNDc3YzljNGU1N2NjNGM0ZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/a95f8aebe9ca1f3bb89d91b698e75876a8ad6066","sha":"a95f8aebe9ca1f3bb89d91b698e75876a8ad6066","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/a95f8aebe9ca1f3bb89d91b698e75876a8ad6066"}],"sha":"0ef40778cd98c3f10bc0e5a477c9c4e57cc4c4d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/0ef40778cd98c3f10bc0e5a477c9c4e57cc4c4d1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/a95f8aebe9ca1f3bb89d91b698e75876a8ad6066/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T01:01:07Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T01:01:07Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"fix(cassandra repo): @AllowFiltering on partial-partition-key search methods\n\nInvestigation (prompted by the new composite-key search ITs returning 500) showed the\ngenerated list search-form drives *progressive prefix search* — it calls\nfindAllByCompositeId<partition-prefix>Pageable as the user fills fewer key fields — so the\npartial-partition-key methods are a real (but broken) feature, not dead code. Cassandra\nrejects a query that restricts only part of the partition key without ALLOW FILTERING, so\nthose endpoints 500''d.\n\nFix: generatePrimaryKeyMethods now computes partitionCount from the non-clustered ids and\nannotates ONLY the partial-partition findAllBy repository methods (param prefix shorter than\nthe full partition key — both the List and Slice overloads) with\n@org.springframework.data.cassandra.repository.AllowFiltering (FQN, no template import).\nFull-partition / clustering / findBy queries are valid without it and stay unannotated.\n\nWith the endpoints now functional, generateCompositeKeySearchResourceITTests asserts 200 for\nALL search endpoints (the earlier full-partition-only scoping is removed). TESTING.md §4.2\nupdated, including the ALLOW-FILTERING performance caveat.\n\nValidated: regen + cassandrablog backend 216 ITs / 0 failures (zero CassandraInvalidQueryException),\ngenerator Layer-1 12/12, frontend 681 (unchanged).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6a613fde8dfb0c30dc1fc5d53e656072aee76050","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/6a613fde8dfb0c30dc1fc5d53e656072aee76050"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/a95f8aebe9ca1f3bb89d91b698e75876a8ad6066","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/a95f8aebe9ca1f3bb89d91b698e75876a8ad6066","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyAINoAKGE5NWY4YWViZTljYTFmM2JiODlkOTFiNjk4ZTc1ODc2YThhZDYwNjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/1c456ec2a7479803c09bd37d2ac18df2b3b91942","sha":"1c456ec2a7479803c09bd37d2ac18df2b3b91942","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/1c456ec2a7479803c09bd37d2ac18df2b3b91942"}],"sha":"a95f8aebe9ca1f3bb89d91b698e75876a8ad6066","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/a95f8aebe9ca1f3bb89d91b698e75876a8ad6066"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/1c456ec2a7479803c09bd37d2ac18df2b3b91942/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T00:45:44Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T00:45:44Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"test(composite-key search): cover the generated partition/clustering search endpoints\n\nThe blueprint generates a ladder of composite-key search endpoints per entity (partial-key\nfindAllBy + cursor-paged -pageable variants, clustering comparison operators, full-key findBy,\nfindLatestBy, and /slice) but shipped with no automated coverage on either tier.\n\nBackend (ResourceIT): add generateCompositeKeySearchResourceITTests() to\ncassandra-spring-data-cassandra-utils.js, mirroring generatePrimaryKeyMethods'' own iteration so\nthe test set stays in lockstep with the endpoints. It emits one getAll<Entity>sByCompositeKeySearches\nIT that persists a row and asserts HTTP 200 for each endpoint (verifies the derived CQL + param\nbinding executes against the real Cassandra Testcontainer). Wired into _entityClass_ResourceIT.java.ejs\ngated on primaryKeySaathratri.composite.\n\nPartition-key rule: Cassandra rejects a query that restricts only PART of the partition key\n(needs ALLOW FILTERING → 500). The generator computes partitionCount from the non-clustered ids and\nonly asserts endpoints whose prefix covers the full partition key (+ clustering prefixes). This\nsurfaced that the blueprint also emits partial-partition-key endpoints which are non-functional at\nruntime; they are deliberately left unasserted rather than masked (see TESTING.md §4.2).\n\nFrontend (service spec): add a ''composite-key search methods'' describe to\n_entityFile_.service.spec.ts.ejs mirroring service.ts.ejs''s method generation; mocked HTTP, so it\nalso covers the partial-partition methods.\n\nValidated by regen of jhipster-cassandra-example: cassandrablog backend 216 ITs / 0 failures,\nfrontend 681 passed; generator Layer-1 12/12.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"abcfc9764dd7f1d85f9fb7c659ba0320164549cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/abcfc9764dd7f1d85f9fb7c659ba0320164549cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/1c456ec2a7479803c09bd37d2ac18df2b3b91942","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/1c456ec2a7479803c09bd37d2ac18df2b3b91942","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyAINoAKDFjNDU2ZWMyYTc0Nzk4MDNjMDliZDM3ZDJhYzE4ZGYyYjNiOTE5NDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/f0ace4a6a94ffa1c97568103412f163d0b33e8b4","sha":"f0ace4a6a94ffa1c97568103412f163d0b33e8b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/gen