03412f163d0b33e8b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/f0ace4a6a94ffa1c97568103412f163d0b33e8b4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/d43cad63446d8f84bf8d7bc9847d127056cb2400/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-30T16:08:12Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T16:08:12Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"fix(cypress): patch single-key-only apps + clear lint (store e2e green)\n\nRoot cause of cassandrastore e2e federation timeouts: the cypress\nPOST_WRITING_ENTITIES task early-returned via `if (compositeByApiUrl.size\n=== 0) return;` for apps with no composite-key entities (store has only\nsingle-key product/report), so it never reached the cy.wait timeout-bump\nand intercept-widen patches. Those single-key specs kept the stock 5s wait\nand `+(?*|)` glob, which time out under microfrontend cold-load\n(\"No request ever occurred\"). Remove the early return (the composite loop\nright after is already per-entity guarded); also drop the earlier\n`if (!idField) continue` so single-key specs reach the patches.\n\nResult: cassandrastore e2e now passes 18/18 (was 2/3 specs failing).\n\nAlso: eslint --fix the pre-existing prefer-template errors in\ncassandra-spring-boot/generator.js so `npm test` (prettier-check && lint)\nis fully green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c89a62ec554dc394b736ee6377f8d023ab8fdf4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/c89a62ec554dc394b736ee6377f8d023ab8fdf4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/d43cad63446d8f84bf8d7bc9847d127056cb2400","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/