I prettier-check)\n\nThe `npm test` pretest (prettier-check) was failing CI on pre-existing\nformatting debt in README.md (and CONTRIBUTING.md). Run prettier --write\non both so the gate passes.\n\nAlso: in the cypress generator''s entity-patch loop, don''t early-`continue`\nwhen an entity has no @Id field. Single-key Cassandra entities whose PK is\nnot an @Id-annotated entity field still need the cy.wait timeout bump and\nintercept-widen patches; guard only the id-dependent sample/form-fill blocks\non idField.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf1e6f988d469d6f651a34c0a9f0668b48f4467a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/bf1e6f988d469d6f651a34c0a9f0668b48f4467a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/b70f5401deee5c86b4938f8351380e5a2c8c88ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"publi