email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"test+fix: UUID generate-button e2e, embedding round-trip IT, search-form spec, partial-update mapper fix\n\n- update form: add data-cy hooks (<field>-generate / <field>-reset) to the UUID and\n  TIMEUUID Generate/Reset buttons (single-key and composite-key branches).\n- cypress: add an e2e test that clicks Generate (asserts a valid UUID lands) and Reset\n  (asserts the field clears) for UUID/TIMEUUID key fields.\n- ResourceIT: add a CqlVector round-trip IT (persist then read back via getPersisted).\n- list spec: add a search-form validity test (form invalid/inactive until a partition\n  key is entered) for composite-key entities.\n- mapper: the partialUpdate override for vector fields dropped the base EntityMapper''s\n  @Named + @BeanMapping(nullValuePropertyMappingStrategy=IGNORE); restore them so partial\n  update preserves non-provided fields instead of nulling them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5dbf405f40b19a0b950a50e66fdc1eebe7226fb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/5dbf405f40b19a0b950a50e66fdc1eebe7226fb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/c45b5cceb0b6528660381e121c61de5c32b59067","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/c45b5cceb0b6528660381e121c61de5c32b59067","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyAINoAKGM0NWI1Y2NlYjBiNjUyODY2MDM4MWUxMjFjNjFkZTVjMzJiNTkwNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/1c4e0196e690ec2d98acfc5ac2ea09d72e173051","sha":"1c4e0196e690ec2d98acfc5ac2ea09d72e173051","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/1c4e0196e690ec2d98acfc5ac2ea09d72e173051"}],"sha":"c45b5cceb0b6528660381e121c61de5c32b59067","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/c45b5cceb0b6528660381e121c61de5c32b59067"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/1c4e0196e690ec2d98acfc5ac2ea09d72e173051/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T18:39:00Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T18:39:00Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"fix(cypress): force the AM/PM mat-option click in date-time sub-input test\n\nFor a date-time widget low on the page (e.g. Post.publishedDateTime), the CDK\noverlay opens with the AM option''s center off-screen/covered, so Cypress''s\nactionability check (\"center hidden from view\") blocked the unforced click.\nThe toggle open was already forced; force the option click too.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"36ef3d6c0fb2486cfdc99dbbc118c57f9f9cb674","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/36ef3d6c0fb2486cfdc99dbbc118c57f9f9cb674"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/1c4e0196e690ec2d98acfc5ac2ea09d72e173051","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.g