:"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/5bc8a302df19c324aeabad4c9ca0fec22da5a74b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T18:21:33Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T18:21:33Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"fix(cypress): navigate search-form smoke test via mf-prefixed PageUrl\n\nThe Cassandra search-form e2e test used cy.clickOnEntityMenuItem(entityFileName),\nwhich looks for a .dropdown-item[href=\"/<entity>\"] — but microfrontend entity\nroutes are prefixed with the remote baseName (e.g. /cassandrablog/<entity>), so\nthe item was never found and the test timed out. Navigate straight to the spec''s\nown <entityInstance>PageUrl constant (mf-prefixed) like the CRUD tests'' beforeEach.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"408ea4286b203737e8c2d8aee4e3829c1e1a49b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/408ea4286b203737e8c2d8aee4e3829c1e1a49b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/5bc8a302df19c324aeabad4c9ca0fec22da5a74b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-