,"user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/d4342e683e6c04e9dc34d1ecaf19761e86d82381/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T16:23:14Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T16:23:14Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"test: cover vector ANN / AI-search + search form across all layers\n\nGenerated code for the Cassandra vector stack (vector<float,N> columns + SAI\nindexes, EmbeddingService, findSimilarBy* ANN queries, aiSearch service, and\nthe /ai-search endpoint) plus the composite-key search form was previously\nuntested. Add template-level coverage so it regenerates per entity:\n\n- backend unit: EmbeddingServiceTest (mocked EmbeddingModel, runs offline)\n- backend IT: /ai-search end-to-end exercising the real ANN query against the\n  Cassandra 5 Testcontainer (gated on !reactive && !serviceNo)\n- frontend (Vitest): search-form tests (toggleSearchForm / performSearch /\n  clearSearch), gated on composite primary key\n- e2e (Cypress): search-form toggle smoke test (uses existing data-cy hooks)\n\nThe bundled sample.jdl gives Product a vector field. Docs in TESTING.md (5.3).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9f33f6a242010f29fab0c5bc8232c2fbbcd69fb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/9f33f6a242010f29fab0c5bc8232c2fbbcd69fb6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/d4342e683e6c04e9dc34d1ecaf19761e86d82381","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/d4342e683e6c04e9dc34d1ecaf19761e86d82381","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyAINoAKGQ0MzQyZTY4M2U2YzA0ZTlkYzM0ZDFlY2FmMTk3NjFlODZkODIzODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/34bf4e7e436635fb115a5ba7d0637afb3183c150","sha":"34bf4e7e436635fb115a5ba7d0637afb3183c150","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/34bf4e7e436635fb115a5ba7d0637afb3183c150"}],"sha":"d4342e683e6c04e9dc34d1ecaf19761e86d82381","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/d4342e683e6c04e9dc34d1ecaf19761e86d82381"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/34bf4e7e436635fb115a5ba7d0637afb3183c150/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T03:13:03Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T03:13:03Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"fix(cypress): final actionability + assertion polish for date-time + MAP<BOOLEAN>\n\nThree small fixes that the full e2e revealed:\n\n  1. (c.7) hours/minutes sub-input typing. The component''s `(input)` handler\n     runs `padZero` on every keystroke, replacing the input value mid-type —\n     typing ''10'' character-by-character lands as ''01''. Switch to\n     `cy.invoke(''val'', ''10'').trigger(''input'', { force: true })`: a single\n     atomic value-set + one synthetic input event. Mirrors a paste,\n     exercises the same DOM path, no character-by-character race.\n\n  2. (c.7) required-field ampm cover. Required UTC_DATETIME composite-key\n     fields render a `<span class=\"mdc-floating-label--required\">` (red\n     asterisk) that covers the `<mat-select>` until first focus, so\n     `cy.click()` on the ampm fails. Force-flag the open click.\n\n  3. (c.9) MAP<BOOLEAN> round-trip assertion. The two-click pattern (null →\n     on → off) commits `false`, not `true`. Match the assertion to reality.\n\nAfter these, the full cassandrablog e2e suite is green:\n  All specs passed!     02:58     131     131     -     -     -\n\nCo-