ndra/commits/dee1954a07cd20c71cd3e017caf69b5ccd7aa7dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T23:12:05Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T23:12:05Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"fix(cypress): target mat-slide-toggle''s inner button (host clicks don''t propagate)\n\nThe previous fix (a2a1f0c) added `{ force: true }` to the host-level\n`cy.get([data-cy=\"…-add-toggle\"]).click(...)` but the toggle still didn''t\nfire. mat-slide-toggle''s interactive element is a `<button role=\"switch\">`\nINSIDE the host — click events bubble UP, not down, so a synthetic click\non the host doesn''t reach the inner button''s handler. The `newValue`\nformControl stays at `null`, the form stays invalid, the Add button stays\ndisabled.\n\nDrill the selector into `[data-cy=\"…-add-toggle\"] button` (and\n`[data-cy=\"dialog-edit-toggle\"] button`) so the click lands on the actual\nswitch. Two clicks per add-toggle site still preserved — guarantees the\nControlValueAccessor commits a non-null value regardless of MDC''s\nstarting visual state.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fb83c89043240048ab9c36b0ba6ae8d653e9dbd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/fb83c89043240048ab9c36b0ba6ae8d653e9dbd1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/dee1954a07cd20c71cd3e017caf69b5ccd7aa7dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/dee1954a07cd20c71cd3e017caf69b5ccd7aa7dc","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyAINoAKGRlZTE5NTRhMDdjZDIwYzcxY2QzZTAxN2NhZjY5YjVjY2Q3YWE3ZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/e457c26d226bfa36fab46ce7646d3ba9acc7be8a","sha":"e457c26d226bfa36fab46ce7646d3ba9acc7be8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/e457c26d226bfa36fab46ce7646d3ba9acc7be8a"}],"sha":"dee1954a07cd20c71cd3e017caf69b5ccd7aa7dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/dee1954a07cd20c71cd3e017caf69b5ccd7aa7dc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/e457c26d226bfa36fab46ce7646d3ba9acc7be8a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T23:03:24Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T23:03:24Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"fix(cypress): MAP<BOOLEAN> Add-row needs two slide-toggle clicks\n\nThe Add-row''s `newValue` formControl starts at `null` with\n`Validators.required`. A single mat-slide-toggle click flips the visual\nstate but does not commit a non-null value to the form via\nControlValueAccessor — the form stays invalid and the Add button stays\ndisabled. A second click (null → true → false, or null → on → off → on\ndepending on starting visual) finalizes the binding.\n\nEvery MAP<BOOLEAN> Add-row interaction in passes (c.8), (c.9), (c.10),\nand (c.11) now emits two consecutive clicks on `<field>-add-toggle`.\nAdded a comment block at (c.8) explaining the rationale so future\nmaintainers know it''s not a copy-paste mistake.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"55d69f281f872a7ae5f1874166944fb0b29eaaf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/55d69f281f872a7ae5f1874166944fb0b29eaaf9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/e457c26d226bfa36fab46ce7646d3ba9acc7be8a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/e457c26d226bfa36fab46ce7646d3ba9acc7be8a","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyAINoAKGU0NTdjMjZkMjI2YmZhMzZmYWI0NmNlNzY0NmQzYmE5YWNjN2JlOGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/5beed039df85a73b1414b701feeb2fd2abbbc8bb","sha":"5beed039df85a73b1414b701feeb2fd2abbbc8bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/5beed039df85a73b1414b701feeb2fd2abbbc8bb"}],"sha":"e457c26d226bfa36fab46ce7646d3ba9acc7be8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/e457c26d226bfa36fab46ce7646d3ba9acc7be8a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/5beed039df85a73b1414b701feeb2fd2abbbc8bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T22:51:11Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T22:51:11Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"fix(cypress): MAP<DAYJS> mis-classification + Material widget actionability\n\nThree e2e failures observed in the cassandrablog example:\n\n  1. AddOnsAvailableByOrganization.addOnDetailsBigInt is annotated\n     [MAP, BIGINT, \"UTC_DATETIME\"] but the `dateTimeFields` filter only\n     checked `.includes(\"UTC_DATETIME\")`, so it picked up the MAP field too —\n     then passes (c.6) and (c.7) tried to drive a top-level <app-date-time>\n     and `<field>-{hours,minutes,…}` scalars that don''t exist for a MAP-wrapped\n     datetime. Fix: also require `ann[0]` to NOT be `CassandraType.Name.MAP`\n     or `…SET`.\n\n  2. `<mat-slide-toggle>` host click doesn''t propagate to its inner\n     `<button role=\"switch\">` in newer Material, so `valueChanges` never\n     fires, the form''s required `newValue` stays null, and the Add button\n     stays disabled. Fix: append `{ force: true }` to every `.click()` on\n     `<field>-add-toggle` and `dialog-edit-toggle`.\n\n  3. `<mat-form-field>` renders `<mat-label>` over the date input until\n     first focus, so Cypress fails actionability on `.type(''1/15/2030'')`.\n     Fix: append `, { force: true }` to the date-input typing in the\n     MAP<DAYJS> Add-row interactions (passes c.9 and c.11).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a35419969ed01564b3ab536dc86c385968a6105d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/a35419969ed01564b3ab536dc86c385968a6105d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/5beed039df85a73b1414b701feeb2fd2abbbc8bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/5beed039df85a73b1414b701feeb2fd2abbbc8bb","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyAINoAKDViZWVkMDM5ZGY4NWE3M2IxNDE0YjcwMWZlZWIyZmQyYWJiYmM4YmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/9598c6fe9d1104b3b4da5d47dc6b5409fac77f90","sha":"9598c6fe9d1104b3b4da5d47dc6b5409fac77f90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/9598c6fe9d1104b3b4da5d47dc6b5409fac77f90"}],"sha":"5beed039df85a73b1414b701feeb2fd2abbbc8bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/5beed039df85a73b1414b701feeb2fd2abbbc8bb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/9598c6fe9d1104b3b4da5d47dc6b5409fac77f90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T22:20:18Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T22:20:18Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"docs: catalogue cypress passes (a → c.11 → d) + widget data-cy hook table\n\nREADME adds an \"E2E Testing with Cypress\" section between MAP screenshots and\nAI search setup — tabulates each widget''s Add-row / per-row / dialog data-cy\nhooks (set-string, map-string/number/boolean/dayjs, app-date-time) and links\nto TESTING.md for the pass catalogue.\n\nTESTING.md §5.2 expands the cypress subsection from \"we only patch DELETE\nURLs\" into a full table of every pass:\n  a/b/c   — sample-body composite/single id, form-fill UUID id field\n  c.5     — strip MAP/SET form-fills\n  c.6/c.7 — UTC_DATETIME Generate click + sub-input smoke\n  c.8     — per-widget MAP/SET smoke tests\n  c.9     — round-trip (now includes MAP<DAYJS> via nested app-date-time)\n  c.10    — per-widget edit-dialog tests\n  c.11    — per-widget delete-row tests\n  d       — composite-key DELETE cleanup URL + intercept-regex widening\n\nPlus a \"Lint-clean codegen\" sub-block noting the inferrable-types and\nunsafe-to-chain-command guarantees the emitter maintains.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ceb5c18be2b7bdf62ffa3e6bd32fd2cfa06c9cbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/ceb5c18be2b7bdf62ffa3e6bd32fd2cfa06c9cbb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/9598c6fe9d1104b3b4da5d47dc6b5409fac77f90","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/recei