s://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/1da6e2531626525ab537add0e7d42fa2c1b18527/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T19:37:46Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T19:37:46Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"feat(cypress): per-row + dialog data-cy hooks; emit edit/delete + MAP<DAYJS> round-trip tests\n\nTemplates: every widget gains per-row data-cy hooks for the edit and delete\nbuttons (`<field>-row-<key|i>-edit`, `<field>-row-<key|i>-delete`); every edit\ndialog gains `dialog-save-button`, `dialog-edit-value`, `dialog-edit-toggle`.\nThe map-dayjs Add-row now binds `[fieldName]=\"fieldName + ''-add-datetime''\"` on\nits nested <app-date-time> so the date/hours/minutes/ampm sub-inputs are\naddressable from cypress.\n\nCypress generator passes added:\n  (c.10) per-widget Edit-dialog tests — add a row, open its edit dialog,\n         modify the value (or toggle), save, assert the dialog closes.\n  (c.11) per-widget Delete-row tests — add a row, click delete, assert the\n         row''s data-cy hook no longer exists.\nRound-trip (c.9) now includes MAP<DAYJS> by typing into the nested date-time\nsub-inputs (no Generate button is rendered inside the Add row).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fa08a1f9b830df07883500fd14b1f3a962a293ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/fa08a1f9b830df07883500fd14b1f3a962a293ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/1da6e2531626525ab537add0e7d42fa2c1b18527","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/1da6e2531626525ab537add0e7d42fa2c1b18527","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyAINoAKDFkYTZlMjUzMTYyNjUyNWFiNTM3YWRkMGU3ZDQyZmEyYzFiMTg1Mjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/59f04c042e0080dd4a9300b5f7a0b1e1cbdca0b2","sha":"59f04c042e0080dd4a9300b5f7a0b1e1cbdca0b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/59f04c042e0080dd4a9300b5f7a0b1e1cbdca0b2"}],"sha":"1da6e2531626525ab537add0e7d42fa2c1b18527","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/1da6e2531626525ab537add0e7d42fa2c1b18527"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/59f04c042e0080dd4a9300b5f7a0b1e1cbdca0b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T19:00:05Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T19:00:05Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"feat(cypress): emit MAP/SET round-trip test for affected entities\n\nFor each entity with MAP or SET fields, generate a `should round-trip MAP/SET\nwidget entries through POST` test that:\n\n1. Reuses the scalar form fills from the existing `should create an instance\n   of X` test (copied verbatim — keeps composite-key / required-field values\n   in sync with the create-instance variant).\n2. Inserts widget Add-row interactions (key + value/toggle + add-button) for\n   each MAP/SET widget on the entity.\n3. Clicks Save and asserts the POST response status is 201 AND the response\n   body contains the widget entries.\n\nThis is the round-trip path that smoke tests can''t reach:\n  Angular widget → form (dataChange emit) → DTO → REST → service → DAO →\n  Cassandra → DAO → service → DTO → JSON → cy.wait response.body\n\nCatches:\n- Widget emits wrong Map/Set shape (currently silent — smoke tests just\n  verify the data-cy hooks are wired)\n- Backend Jackson (de)serialization breaks for these custom types\n- DTO field name drift between Angular model and Java DTO\n\nExcludes MAP<DAYJS>: interacting with the nested <app-date-time> inside the\nAdd row to populate a value requires either typing into sub-inputs with\nform-validation timing or clicking a Generate-style button (which doesn''t\nexist on the nested date-time within the Add row). Smoke test for\nMAP<BIGINT/DATETIME> only verifies hooks; full round-trip is deferred.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"151145ed4fe851b7bd91cc70009fca424b5708bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/151145ed4fe851b7bd91cc70009fca424b5708bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/59f04c042e0080dd4a9300b5f7a0b1e1cbdca0b2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/59f04c042e0080dd4a9300b5f7a0b1e1cbdca0b2","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyAINoAKDU5ZjA0YzA0MmUwMDgwZGQ0YTkzMDBiNWY3YTBiMWUxY2JkY2EwYjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/a3f86c705b29f88a870173df9b92188006c2e959","sha":"a3f86c705b29f88a870173df9b92188006c2e959","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/a3f86c705b29f88a870173df9b92188006c2e959"}],"sha":"59f04c042e0080dd4a9300b5f7a0b1e1cbdca0b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/59f04c042e0080dd4a9300b5f7a0b1e1cbdca0b2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/a3f86c705b29f88a870173df9b92188006c2e959/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T18:48:39Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T18:48:39Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"feat(cypress): add data-cy hooks + smoke tests for SET and 4 MAP widgets\n\nMirrors the date-time widget pattern (3b7401b) for the remaining 5 custom\nAngular widget components:\n\n- set-string-component  (SET<TEXT>)\n- map-string-component  (MAP<TEXT, TEXT>)\n- map-number-component  (MAP<TEXT, DECIMAL>)\n- map-boolean-component (MAP<TEXT, BOOLEAN>)\n- map-dayjs-component   (MAP<TEXT, BIGINT/UTC_DATETIME>)\n\nComponent .ts.ejs (×5): add `@Input() fieldName: string = '''';` after the\nexisting `@Input() inputFields`. Lets each widget scope its data-cy hooks\nto a unique field name so multiple widgets on the same form don''t collide.\n\nComponent .html.ejs (×5): add `[attr.data-cy]=\"fieldName + ''-add-{key,value,toggle,button}''\"`\non the Add-row inputs and Add button.\n- SET: -add-value, -add-button\n- MAP<TEXT>:    -add-key, -add-value, -add-button\n- MAP<DECIMAL>: -add-key, -add-value (number), -add-button\n- MAP<BOOLEAN>: -add-key, -add-toggle, -add-button\n- MAP<DAYJS>:   -add-key, -add-datetime (nested app-date-time), -add-button\n\nEntity update.html.ejs: pass fieldName=\"<%= field.fieldName %>\" to every\n<app-*-component> wrapper so the data-cy bindings have a value at runtime.\n\nCypress generator POST_WRITING_ENTITIES (c.8): emit per-widget smoke tests\ninside the `describe(''new <Entity> page'', ...)` block. Each test verifies\nthe Add-row hooks accept input and the Add button is reachable (and\ndisabled-state where applicable). Narrow checks that catch data-cy\nregressions without driving the full add/edit/delete cycle.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"43e4f011d9be99e2035a1ba17c4698e0836eed50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/tree