?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/3b7401ba530f02a3762b9f3f2640d453c4344c7e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T18:39:03Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T18:39:03Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"feat(cypress): add data-cy hooks + widget smoke tests for app-date-time\n\nAdd `[attr.data-cy]=\"fieldName + ''-{date,hours,minutes,ampm}''\"` bindings to\nthe date-time component template''s sub-inputs. Then in cypress generator\nPOST_WRITING_ENTITIES (c.7), for each entity with UTC_DATETIME fields,\nemit a smoke test `should accept input on the <field> date-time widget\nsub-inputs` per field — verifies hours/minutes/AM/PM inputs accept input\nand the form control responds.\n\nThis complements (c.6)''s Generate-button click in the main create test:\n- (c.6) test confirms the Generate-shortcut path that real users hit\n- (c.7) smoke tests confirm the underlying widget data-cy hooks are wired\n  (catches regressions where the widget template breaks but Generate still\n  works, or vice versa).\n\nThe smoke tests don''t try to Save — they don''t need scalar field fills\nthat would duplicate the (c.6) test. They focus narrowly on widget\nbehavior.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e45953cb33d02d043a3f17870a240551a28aa62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/9e45953cb33d02d043a3f17870a240551a28aa62"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/3b7401ba530f02a3762b9f3f2640d453c4344c7e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/3b7401ba530f02a3762b9f3f2640d453c4344c7e","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyAINoAKDNiNzQwMWJhNTMwZjAyYTM3NjJiOWYzZjI2NDBkNDUzYzQzNDRjN2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/12d4a5298aca04fc6dab06e19c0c114582906e0a","sha":"12d4a5298aca04fc6dab06e19c0c114582906e0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/12d4a5298aca04fc6dab06e19c0c114582906e0a"}],"sha":"3b7401ba530f02a3762b9f3f2640d453c4344c7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/3b7401ba530f02a3762b9f3f2640d453c4344c7e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/12d4a5298aca04fc6dab06e19c0c114582906e0a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T18:32:24Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T18:32:24Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"fix(cypress): exercise UTC_DATETIME custom <app-date-time> widget via Generate button\n\nUTC_DATETIME fields render a custom <app-date-time> component, not a simple\ninput — there''s no data-cy=\"<field>\" matching the upstream form-fill pattern,\nso `cy.get(''[data-cy=\"addedDateTime\"]'').type(...)` times out. The component\nships with a sibling \"Generate\" button (only when @if (isNew)) that wires\nthrough generateDateTime(''compositeId.<field>'') to populate a sensible\ndefault value.\n\nPOST_WRITING_ENTITIES editFile now (c.6):\n- Detects fields whose customAnnotation array contains \"UTC_DATETIME\".\n- Strips the upstream `cy.get(''[data-cy=\"<field>\"]'')…` form-fill lines.\n- Injects `cy.get(''app-date-time[fieldName=\"<field>\"]'').parent()\n  .contains(''button'', ''Generate'').click();` immediately before the\n  Save-button click in the `should create an instance of X` test.\n\nRequired for composite-key UTC_DATETIME (Post.addedDateTime) so the form\npasses validation; harmless for optional ones (Post.publishedDateTime).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cfda19e1dc95ba67c7a1f7aa496fcd6ed3d1b54b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/cfda19e1dc95ba67c7a1f7aa496fcd6ed3d1b54b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/12d4a5298aca04fc6dab06e19c0c114582906e0a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/12d4a5298aca04fc6dab06e19c0c114582906e0a","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyAINoAKDEyZDRhNTI5OGFjYTA0ZmM2ZGFiMDZlMTljMGMxMTQ1ODI5MDZlMGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/dba7795d853e24ebeca391bfbb7fa26ee498ac94","sha":"dba7795d853e24ebeca391bfbb7fa26ee498ac94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/dba7795d853e24ebeca391bfbb7fa26ee498ac94"}],"sha":"12d4a5298aca04fc6dab06e19c0c114582906e0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/12d4a5298aca04fc6dab06e19c0c114582906e0a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/dba7795d853e24ebeca391bfbb7fa26ee498ac94/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T18:18:43Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T18:18:43Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"fix(cypress): strip MAP/SET form-fill lines from `should create an instance of X`\n\nThe cassandra blueprint generates custom Angular widgets for\nMAP<TEXT, TEXT/DECIMAL/BOOLEAN/BIGINT> and SET<TEXT> columns (key/value\nrows, toggles, date pickers — see screenshots in jhipster-cassandra-example\nREADME). These don''t expose a single `<input data-cy=\"<fieldName>\">`, so the\nupstream Cypress template''s `cy.get(''[data-cy=\"<map>\"]'').type(...)` times\nout with \"Expected to find element: `[data-cy=\\\"addOnDetailsText\\\"]`, but\nnever found it.\"\n\nConfirmed on user''s run: every entity with MAP fields\n(AddOnsAvailableByOrganization, AddOnsSelectedByOrganization,\nLandingPageByOrganization) and SET fields (SaathratriEntity3,\nSetEntityByOrganization) failed only the `should create an instance of X`\ntest on a MAP/SET selector. Scalar-only entities (Blog, Post, Tag,\nSaathratriEntity2, etc.) reached 7/7 green.\n\nExtend the existing POST_WRITING_ENTITIES editFile with a new pass that:\n\n- Identifies MAP/SET fields via the first element of `customAnnotation`\n  (`CassandraType.Name.MAP` or `CassandraType.Name.SET`).\n- For each, strips every `cy.get(\\`[data-cy=\"<fieldName>\"]\\`).<chain>;` line\n  from the spec (covers .type/.should/.click/.invoke regardless of args).\n- MAP/SET columns aren''t required in the JDL, so the form stays valid for\n  submit without those fields filled.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"751adb3e9273814bdb9fd4511686fa33aa4aa469","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/751adb3e9273814bdb9fd4511686fa33aa4aa469"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/dba7795d853e24ebeca391bfbb7fa26ee498ac94","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/dba7795d853e24ebeca391bfbb7fa26ee498ac94","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyAINoAKGRiYTc3OTVkODUzZTI0ZWJlY2EzOTFiZmJiN2ZhMjZlZTQ5OGFjOTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/eaeacf667b8a12d5270403836d10783a6c42d4d1","sha":"eaeacf667b8a12d5270403836d10783a6c42d4d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/eaeacf667b8a12d5270403836d10783a6c42d4d1"}],"sha":"dba7795d853e24ebeca391bfbb7fa26ee498ac94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/dba7795d853e24ebeca391bfbb7fa26ee498ac94"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/eaeacf667b8a12d5270403836d10783a6c42d4d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T18:06:09Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T18:06:09Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"fix(cypress): emit regex intercept (not ** glob) for entitiesRequest URL\n\nThe previous `**` patch (369cacb) was wrong: in minimatch, `**` only crosses\npath separators when it''s a STANDALONE segment. Attached to a non-`/` segment\nlike `<entity>**`, it degrades to single-segment `*` and can''t match the\n`/slice` that the cassandra pagination overhaul appends to the list GET URL.\nConfirmed by user''s Cypress run: the GET to\n`/api/add-ons-available-by-organizations/slice?size=20` returned 200, the\npage rendered, but `cy.wait(''@entitiesRequest'')` still timed out at 30s.\n\nConvert the intercept URL from string glob to regex literal anchored with\n`\\b` (word boundary). The regex matches:\n\n  /<entity>            (end-of-string)\n  /<entity>?...        (boundary before `?`)\n  /<entity>/slice      (boundary before `/`)\n  /<entity>/slice?...  (boundary before `/`)\n\nForward slashes are escaped because `/` is the regex delimiter in the\nemitted source — un-escaped `/` would terminate the regex literal early.\n\nCatches both the previous `+(?*|)` form (from un-patched files) and the\nintermediate `**` form (from already-patched files) so re-running the\neditFile on an in-flight regen is idempotent.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"320861d6db076c40f269e8016e96b011958bba64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/320861d6db076c40f269e8016e96b011958bba64"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/eaeacf667b8a12d5270403836d10783a6c42d4d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/eaeacf667b8a12d5270403836d10783a6c42d4d1","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyAINoAKGVhZWFjZjY2N2I4YTEyZDUyNzA0MDM4MzZkMTA3ODNhNmM0MmQ0ZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/369cacb13e34e43155ccab72e6836546c52e4131","sha":"369cacb13e34e43155ccab72e6836546c52e4131","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/369cacb13e34e43155ccab72e6836546c52e4131"}],"sha":"eaeacf667b8a12d5270403836d10783a6c42d4d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/eaeacf667b8a12d5270403836d10783a6c42d4d1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/369cacb13e34e43155ccab72e6836546c52e4131/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T17:49:52Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T17:49:52Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"fix(cypress): widen entitiesRequest intercept glob to match /slice URLs\n\nUpstream JHipster emits `cy.intercept(''GET'', ''/services/<svc>/api/<entity>+(?*|)'')`\nwhich only matches the base path optionally followed by `?...`. The cassandra\npagination overhaul (v1.0.14) replaced the page-number list GET with a\npaginated `/api/<entity>/slice?size=20` endpoint, so the upstream pattern\nnever matches and `cy.wait(''@entitiesRequest'')` times out\n\"No request ever occurred.\" even though the GET returns 200 (visible in the\nCypress Routes panel).\n\nAdd a per-entity POST_WRITING_ENTITIES editFile that replaces `+(?*|)` with\n`**` (minimatch globstar) in every intercept URL. The `**` pattern matches\n`/<entity>`, `/<entity>?...`, `/<entity>/slice`, and `/<entity>/slice?...`,\ncovering both the outer and the inner (\"entitiesRequestInternal\") intercepts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dfd849e90384be3b7c924e91823e4e578d00d4ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/dfd849e90384be3b7c924e91823e4e578d00d4ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/369cacb13e34e43155ccab72e6836546c52e4131","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/369cacb13e34e43155ccab72e6836546c52e4131","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyAINoAKDM2OWNhY2IxM2UzNGU0MzE1NWNjYWI3MmU2ODM2NTQ2YzUyZTQxMzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/a5b50e3134ae11404f0c04df96a7d50d67d5957e","sha":"a5b50e3134ae11404f0c04df96a7d50d67d5957e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/a5b50e3134ae11404f0c04df96a7d50d67d5957e"}],"sha":"369cacb13e34e43155ccab72e6836546c52e4131","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/369cacb13e34e43155ccab72e6836546c52e4131"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/a5b50e3134ae11404f0c04df96a7d50d67d5957e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T17:34:50Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T17:34:50Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"fix(cypress): drop intermediate .find(entityItemSelector) in clickOnEntityMenuItem\n\nThe previous timeout patch (30852b2) was a misdiagnosis. The 30s retry never\nhelped because the dropdown items literally aren''t in the toggle''s DOM subtree —\nthe cassandra-angular per-microfrontend navbar puts data-cy=\"cassandrablogMenu\"\non the `<a ngbDropdownToggle>` while the items live in a SIBLING\n`<ul ngbDropdownMenu>`. Upstream''s\n`cy.get(navbar).find(entityItemSelector).find(''.dropdown-item[href=...]'')`\nsearches *inside* the toggle and times out regardless of duration.\n\nConfirmed by user screenshot: dropdown items DO render correctly in the open\ndropdown; Cypress just can''t see them because of the wrong selector chain.\n\nUpdate the navbar.ts editFile to:\n- Drop `.find(entityItemSelector)` from the second chain so the search runs\n  from `navbarSelector` down to `.dropdown-item[href=...]` (the sibling <ul>\n  is reachable from navbar level).\n- Keep the 30s timeout (still useful for module-federation cold load — items\n  populate after the remote registers, but at least they''re now FINDABLE).\n\nRegex marker renamed from \"SAATHRATRI mf timeout\" to \"SAATHRATRI mf nav\" so\nold patches don''t block this re-patch.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cea2cabac5c45a8402ee158903f7e252f168fdbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/cea2cabac5c45a8402ee158903f7e252f168fdbd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/a5b50e3134ae11404f0c04df96a7d50d67d5957e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/a5b50e3134ae11404f0c04df96a7d50d67d5957e","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyAINoAKGE1YjUwZTMxMzRhZTExNDA0ZjBjMDRkZjk2YTdkNTBkNjdkNTk1N2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/30852b239d3cf5ba56df5e3c45a97fcc09b740e2","sha":"30852b239d3cf5ba56df5e3c45a97fcc09b740e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/30852b239d3cf5ba56df5e3c45a97fcc09b740e2"}],"sha":"a5b50e3134ae11404f0c04df96a7d50d67d5957e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/a5b50e3134ae11404f0c04df96a7d50d67d5957e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/30852b239d3cf5ba56df5e3c45a97fcc09b740e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T17:13:54Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T17:13:54Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"fix(cypress): bump dropdown/wait timeouts for microfrontend cold-load race\n\nThe cassandrablog/cassandrastore remotes are loaded async via webpack module\nfederation — `loadMicrofrontendsEntities()` fires after login as an effect,\nfetches the remoteEntry.js, and only then does `cassandrablogEntityNavbarItems()`\npopulate and `*ngFor` render the dropdown items. In a normal browser there''s\nenough human-time elapsed for that to finish before any click; in Cypress the\ntest fires immediately and Cypress''s default 4s/5s retries aren''t enough on\ncold load, so every entity spec''s first test fails with\n\"Expected to find element: `.dropdown-item[href=\\\"/cassandrablog/blog\\\"]`,\nbut never found it\" and the \"with existing value\" / \"create button click\"\nbeforeEach hooks fail with \"cy.wait() timed out waiting 5000ms for entitiesRequest\"\neven though the POST succeeded and the visit fired.\n\nTwo new editFile patches:\n\nPOST_WRITING:\n- Patch support/navbar.ts: extend the `.find(''.dropdown-item[href=...]'')`\n  retry timeout to 30s inside clickOnEntityMenuItem.\n\nPOST_WRITING_ENTITIES (each entity .cy.ts):\n- Replace `cy.wait(''@entitiesRequest'')` with\n  `cy.wait(''@entitiesRequest'', { timeout: 30000 })`.\n- Same for `cy.wait(''@entitiesRequestInternal'')`.\n\nBoth patches are idempotent (use marker comments / regexes that won''t\nre-match already-patched content).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8f82355be8721f28b83e732c421ae31a5f51c95f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/8f82355be8721f28b83e732c421ae31a5f51c95f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/30852b239d3cf5ba56df5e3c45a97fcc09b740e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/30852b239d3cf5ba56df5e3c45a97fcc09b740e2","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyAINoAKDMwODUyYjIzOWQzY2Y1YmE1NmRmNWUzYzQ1YTk3ZmNjMDliNzQwZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/636fef4b56ef2dba539f3bd9a3a550289aff4267","sha":"636fef4b56ef2dba539f3bd9a3a550289aff4267","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/636fef4b56ef2dba539f3bd9a3a550289aff4267"}],"sha":"30852b239d3cf5ba56df5e3c45a97fcc09b740e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/30852b239d3cf5ba56df5e3c45a97fcc09b740e2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/636fef4b56ef2dba539f3bd9a3a550289aff4267/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T16:40:56Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T16:40:56Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"fix(cypress): use a valid UUID string for UUID-typed sample values\n\nAfter the previous fix, POST bodies now contained `compositeId`/`id` but with\nsample values like `''sample-blogId-1''` — fine for the test-samples Angular\nmodel literals but invalid for `UUID.fromString()` on the backend. Jackson\nfailed deserialization before any controller logic ran, returning\n400 \"Failed to read request\" on every entity POST.\n\nFor fields with fieldType === \"UUID\", emit a static v4-like\n`''00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001''` instead of the\n`''sample-<fieldName>-1''` string. Same value reused across fields/entities;\ncassandra UPSERTs so concurrent reuse of the same UUID is harmless, and\nTIMEUUID-annotated key fields are server-overwritten via `Uuids.timeBased()`\nso the value is disposable for those anyway.\n\nNumeric (Long/Integer/Double/Float/BigDecimal) and Boolean handling\nunchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"80790b36286db4fd1ed0d7a3737c21b445a86d1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/80790b36286db4fd1ed0d7a3737c21b445a86d1a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/636fef4b56ef2dba539f3bd9a3a550289aff4267","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/636fef4b56ef2dba539f3bd9a3a550289aff4267","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyAINoAKDYzNmZlZjRiNTZlZjJkYmE1MzlmM2JkOWEzYTU1MDI4OWFmZjQyNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/5f4c61d62bfb396fd9eca919c64dadf3169ed83c","sha":"5f4c61d62bfb396fd9eca919c64dadf3169ed83c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/5f4c61d62bfb396fd9eca919c64dadf3169ed83c"}],"sha":"636fef4b56ef2dba539f3bd9a3a550289aff4267","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/636fef4b56ef2dba539f3bd9a3a550289aff4267"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/5f4c61d62bfb396fd9eca919c64dadf3169ed83c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T16:10:03Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T16:10:03Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"fix(cypress): inject compositeId/id into sample body + form fill for entity specs\n\nThe upstream JHipster cypress entity-spec template uses generateTestEntity() to\nbuild the POST sample body and a form-fill loop, both of which exclude\nJHipster id fields when `field.id && field.autoGenerate` is true. For cassandra\nthis leaves:\n\n  B. Composite-key entities'' POST body without compositeId → backend 500\n     \"Cannot invoke ...DTOId.setX(...) because ...DTO.getCompositeId() is null\".\n     Affects Blog, Post, SaathratriEntity2/3/4, AddOns* etc.\n  C. Single-key UUID entities'' POST body without id → backend 400\n     \"error.idinvalid\" (cassandra doesn''t auto-generate; client must provide).\n     Affects Tag, SaathratriEntity, TajUser, LandingPageByOrganization,\n     SetEntityByOrganization.\n  D. The corresponding form fill in `should create an instance of X` never\n     types the @Id field, so the Angular form stays invalid and the Save\n     button is `[disabled]`.\n\nExtended the existing cypress POST_WRITING_ENTITIES editFile (which already\nfixes the DELETE URL for composite keys, per TESTING.md §5.2) with two new\npasses that run for every entity with an id field:\n\n(a) Sample body — if composite, inject\n    `compositeId: { <each id field>: <sample value> }` at the head of the\n    `const <entity>Sample = {...}` literal. If single-key, inject just\n    `<idField>: <sample value>`. Sample values match the test-samples\n    template''s logic (numeric for Long/Integer/Double/Float/BigDecimal,\n    boolean for Boolean, `''sample-<fieldName>-1''` string otherwise).\n\n(b) Form fill — find the `it(''should create an instance of <X>'', ...)`\n    block; if the @Id field''s `[data-cy=\"...\"]` selector is not already in\n    the block, inject `cy.get(''[data-cy=\"<idField>\"]'').type(...)` and the\n    matching value assertion at the top of the test. This handles single-key\n    UUIDs (Tag.id, SaathratriEntity.id) and composite-key UUID @Id fields\n    (SaathratriEntity2.entityTypeId) without duplicating for non-UUID @Id\n    fields that upstream already includes (Blog.category — String/TEXT).\n\nIdempotent: both passes skip when the target marker is already present, so\nre-runs on already-patched content are no-ops.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"24aa3a3e12b3e561619d25ce1c1c75f8a9508943","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/24aa3a3e12b3e561619d25ce1c1c75f8a9508943"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/5f4c61d62bfb396fd9eca919c64dadf3169ed83c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/5f4c61d62bfb396fd9eca919c64dadf3169ed83c","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyAINoAKDVmNGM2MWQ2MmJmYjM5NmZkOWVjYTkxOWM2NGRhZGYzMTY5ZWQ4M2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/3aa16e19a1b9c5eacf1188d86960c2741328d2a1","sha":"3aa16e19a1b9c5eacf1188d86960c2741328d2a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/3aa16e19a1b9c5eacf1188d86960c2741328d2a1"}],"sha":"5f4c61d62bfb396fd9eca919c64dadf3169ed83c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/5f4c61d62bfb396fd9eca919c64dadf3169ed83c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/3aa16e19a1b9c5eacf1188d86960c2741328d2a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T15:58:01Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T15:58:01Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"fix(cypress): point entityItemSelector at per-microfrontend dropdown\n\ncassandra-angular restructured the navbar from upstream JHipster''s single\n[data-cy=\"entity\"] flat dropdown into per-microfrontend dropdowns\n(e.g. [data-cy=\"cassandrablogMenu\"], [data-cy=\"cassandrastoreMenu\"]).\nThe Cypress support/commands.ts still declared the old selector, so every\nentity spec''s `clickOnEntityMenuItem(...)` failed with\n\"Expected to find element: [data-cy=\\\"entity\\\"], but never found it.\"\n\nNew POST_WRITING task patches each microservice''s commands.ts to point\nentityItemSelector at its own dropdown ([data-cy=\"<baseName>Menu\"]). Each\nmicroservice''s Cypress suite runs against the gateway and opens *its own*\nnamed dropdown to access its entities. Gated on applicationTypeMicroservice\n(the gateway uses adminMenu for its own Authority entity tests). Idempotent.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9fd901decf2e3815a1fa94690960c629ad47874","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/c9fd901decf2e3815a1fa94690960c629ad47874"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/3aa16e19a1b9c5eacf1188d86960c2741328d2a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verifie