","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/e738fce060028e5214136f30099e85e4457d886c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T05:32:42Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T05:32:42Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"Add TESTING.md — testing & debugging runbook for all layers\n\nDocuments the workflow used to take the generated Cassandra app to green: the golden rule (fix\ntemplates, not generated code), environment setup (proxy CA, Docker), the generate-sample tight\nloop, and how to run + debug each layer — generator unit tests (vitest), generated backend\n(Testcontainers ITs), generated frontend (eslint + vitest). Includes catalogues of the actual\nbackend (composite-key REST, DTO validation, existsById, frozen samples) and frontend\n(compile/runtime/lint) bug patterns with their template fixes, plus cross-cutting techniques\n(categorize-by-rule, ANSI stripping, generated-line→template mapping, `eslint --fix` as a\ndiscovery tool, Windows/Git-Bash gotchas).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6909ae42cc3ee7707885759a9d5311350053bf09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/6909ae42cc3ee7707885759a9d5311350053bf09"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/e738fce060028e5214136f30099e85e4457d886c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.g