=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/1ff6e42e90c59ab17d80cae17cd0137c0d5e21bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T05:26:37Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T05:26:37Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"Frontend lint (8/n): remove stale unused eslint-disable directives — 0 lint problems\n\nRemoved the pre-existing unused-disable directives the earlier modernization made redundant,\nand fixed the two warnings they masked:\n- date-time: dropped 2 unused member-ordering disables (private fields already ordered).\n- update template: dropped the unused member-ordering disable before lastSavedValues and the\n  unused no-unnecessary-condition disable on the date-field validity check.\n- service template: dropped the unused no-unnecessary-condition disable on the Map dayjs cast.\n- shared dayjs utils: `//export` -> `// export` (spaced-comment).\n- set-string component: declare `implements OnChanges` (use-lifecycle-interface) — it has\n  ngOnChanges.\n\nGenerated Cassandra client is now lint-CLEAN: `eslint .` reports 0 problems (0 errors,\n0 warnings) and `npm test` passes (82 files / 407 tests). Effort B fully done.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dc9eb80a6fe95eb1406cd47fc3a612cf378bdba3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cass