s://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/8bb2f61638b6217b849d6cdb52cc3a7157bea549/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T04:54:20Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T04:54:20Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"Frontend lint (4/n): fix member-ordering from the inject() conversion\n\nThe display-component inject() change put private inject fields before the public form field;\nmember-ordering wants public members first. Reordered to declare the public form (and\nnewFieldControl/mapDetails) first, then the private inject fields, initialising the reactive\nform in a parameterless constructor (so it still has FormBuilder, and prefer-inject stays\nsatisfied). Dropped the misplaced member-ordering disables.\n\nGenerated-client eslint errors now 79 (member-ordering cleared); vitest green (407). Note: the\nlint gate (`eslint .`, no --max-warnings) fails only on errors, so the remaining ~17 warnings\n(pre-existing unused-disable directives) don''t block it. Remaining errors: template\ncontrol-flow, list no-unnecessary-condition, edit-dialog prefer-inject, nullish-coalescing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"214646cfe9d358b4fdda7b04134e65fe3313fd2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/214646cfe9d358b4fdda7b04134e65fe3313fd2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/8bb2f61638b6217b849d6cdb52cc3a7157bea549","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"http