EwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/f4d55fdde17ebac737d0c900fb99e8d54b143b2b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T04:48:44Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T04:48:44Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"Frontend lint (3/n): inject() the shared map/set display components; object-shorthand\n\n- Converted the 5 shared map-*/set-string display components from constructor DI to inject()\n  (@angular-eslint/prefer-inject), using field initializers for the reactive form so it still\n  builds after the injected FormBuilder; kept set-string''s constructor only for its\n  populateFormArray() call. Added the member-ordering eslint-disable (as used elsewhere) for\n  the inject fields.\n- Edit-dialog spec mocks: { close: () => {} } -> { close() {} } (object-shorthand).\n\nGenerated-client eslint findings 111 -> ~96; vitest still green (407 tests). Remaining are the\n.html control-flow (*ngIf/*ngFor -> @if/@for), the edit-dialog components'' inject() conversion,\nthe list search-guard no-unnecessary-condition, and nullish-coalescing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e6e3b35518f1bb9450325c02767c927568e1bfb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/e6e3b35518f1bb9450325c02767c927568e1bfb7"},"url":"https://api.git