gFor -> @if/@for), prefer-inject in the shared dialog\ncomponents, no-unnecessary-condition in the list search guards, and nullish-coalescing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c1f9e4c6bab9de112ef8ef63279e0629a20e5fbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/c1f9e4c6bab9de112ef8ef63279e0629a20e5fbb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/28fb0e666c98eb9438ca3ec6e624360bfced6a38","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/28fb0e666c98eb9438ca3ec6e624360bfced6a38","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyAINoAKDI4ZmIwZTY2NmM5OGViOTQzOGNhM2VjNmU2MjQzNjBiZmNlZDZhMzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commit/080d2f845c74ebb22979fe13919de72c71175121","sha":"080d2f845c74ebb22979fe13919de72c71175121","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/080d2f845c74ebb22979fe13919de72c71175121"}],"sha":"28fb0e666c98eb9438ca3ec6e624360bfced6a38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/28fb0e666c98eb9438ca3ec6e624360bfced6a38"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/commits/080d2f845c74ebb22979fe13919de72c71175121/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T04:32:18Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T04:32:18Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"Frontend lint (1/n): drop unnecessary String() conversions and non-null assertions\n\nToward a clean eslint pretest gate for the generated Angular client:\n- service template: options.set(''p'', String(p)) -> options.set(''p'', p). HttpParams.set\n  accepts string|number|boolean, so wrapping already-string key params in String() tripped\n  @typescript-eslint/no-unnecessary-type-conversion (~80).\n- list template: the search-criteria find() args used `this.searchCriteria.field!`, but the\n  enclosing `if` guard already narrows them to non-null, so the `!` tripped\n  @typescript-eslint/no-unnecessary-type-assertion (~120).\n\nGenerated-client eslint findings 351 -> 152; vitest suite still green (407 tests).\nRemaining are concentrated in the list component (member-ordering, no-unnecessary-condition,\nnullish-coalescing, empty constructor) and the shared map/set/date-time components\n(prefer-inject, control-flow), tracked for follow-up commits.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"697002841a98cf51ecb07c979a6a45f7f972d378","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/697002841a98cf51ecb07c979a6a45f7f972d378"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/080d2f845c74ebb22979fe13919de72c71175121","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https: