6T04:16:37Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T04:16:37Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"Frontend tests (7/n): generated Angular vitest suite fully green (407 tests, 0 compile errors)\n\nFinishes the compile-error work and gets every generated-client test passing:\n- service/update/form-service specs now branch single-key vs composite (find(id) vs\n  find(...keys), flat vs nested compositeId form, compare(Pick<I,''id''|''compositeId''>)),\n  written for all entities — fixes the single-key Product specs and 3 residual composite\n  service specs (find() arg used the dayjs model type where find wants the raw number).\n- update.spec: provide ActivatedRoute.snapshot.routeConfig (component derives isNew from it;\n  path:''new'' for the create test) and pass a non-frozen copy of the sample (the component\n  defaults Map/Set props, which threw on the Object.freeze''d sample).\n- list.spec: assert querySlice (the Cassandra list pages via querySlice, not query).\n- route-resolve.spec: match the resolver (no catchError) — it navigates to 404 only when find\n  returns an empty body; dropped the base error-handling assertions it doesn''t implement.\n- edit-dialog component specs (map-*/set-*): provide MatDialogRef + MAT_DIALOG_DATA.\n\nResult: `npx ng test` → 82 files / 407 tests pass, 0 TS errors (down from ~250). `npm test`\nremains gated only by the eslint pretest (the 333-warning component modernization, effort B).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b83ca3ecd631c1b81b2fa050607c58c67cee0ac6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/trees/b83ca3ecd631c1b81b2fa050607c58c67cee0ac6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-cassandra/git/commits/e6b65242ba86fa017aa8c891b56cd0f686591355","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signatu