n earlier backend/frontend phase failed\" — the latter\nwould wrongly skip e2e (previously e2e still ran). Track infra readiness in its own\n`infra_ok` flag so e2e is skipped only when Keycloak/Registry are genuinely unreachable;\na prior-phase failure no longer suppresses e2e.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"30633995ba648a943bcde9d8ebf5de701f50c92b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/git/trees/30633995ba648a943bcde9d8ebf5de701f50c92b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/git/commits/aa084927fcfa955b7ae9fe848efd84f029178d2e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/commit/aa084927fcfa955b7ae9fe848efd84f029178d2e","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyDr9oAKGFhMDg0OTI3ZmNmYTk1NWI3YWU5ZmU4NDhlZmQ4NGYwMjkxNzhkMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/commit/b8dc98f3db7c6f8cf0582f0bf312f2756fb51ca8","sha":"b8dc98f3db7c6f8cf0582f0bf312f2756fb51ca8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/commits/b8dc98f3db7c6f8cf0582f0bf312f2756fb51ca8"}],"sha":"aa084927fcfa955b7ae9fe848efd84f029178d2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/commits/aa084927fcfa955b7ae9fe848efd84f029178d2e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/commits/b8dc98f3db7c6f8cf0582f0bf312f2756fb51ca8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T00:03:23Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T00:03:23Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"test(harness): add fast-fail infra pre-flight (Keycloak OIDC + Registry)\n\nThis harness does not start infra — it assumes a pre-running Docker stack\n(Cassandra/Postgres + Keycloak + JHipster Registry). When that stack is down (or the\nRegistry isn''t live), the remotes can''t register, the gateway gets no routes, and every\nentity e2e 404s after ~5 min of webapp builds + backend launches with an opaque message.\n\nAdd a pre-flight gate at the top of the e2e block: probe Keycloak''s OIDC endpoint\n(:9080) and the Registry health (:8761) up front and skip e2e with an actionable message\nif either is down. (Sibling to the ai-postgresql example''s readiness gate; that harness\nis self-contained and starts the Registry itself, so it orders Keycloak->Registry. This\none only needs to verify infra is already up.)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e21b0844fc447beb820931bb1f137ae1f5887dd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/git/trees/e21b0844fc447beb820931bb1f137ae1f5887dd8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/git/commits/b8dc98f3db7c6f8cf0582f0bf312f2756fb51ca8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/u