 backend\n  launched over an occupied 8080/8081/8082 crashes (\"Port in use\") and e2e then\n  hits a dead :8080; always kill-by-name AND by-port then BLOCK until ports clear.\n  Add rule 3: judge e2e by cypress exit code, not log grep.\n- §5c: prepend the kill+free-ports+wait-until-clear gate before launching backends.\n- §6: add the port-collision and exit-code gotchas.\n- §7: lead with the one-shot; keep the manual steps as the debug path.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1c68252504753d0c1e73ee153e5fbb87d0773ba5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/git/trees/1c68252504753d0c1e73ee153e5fbb87d0773ba5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/git/commits/8432c95c113f19d3ecbd46c56d6fcd60c2f6d381","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/c