make run-all-tests.sh a reliable one-shot (real root cause = port collision)\n\nThe cassandrastore e2e was NOT a Cypress timing flake. The script launched a\nsecond backend trio while a prior trio (or stragglers) still held 8080/8081/8082;\nthe new gateway died with \"Port 8080 was already in use\", so store''s Cypress hit a\ndead :8080 (\"No request ever occurred\" / \"Cypress failed to verify your server\").\n\nFixes:\n- kill_backends now also frees whoever holds 8080/8081/8082, and a new\n  wait_ports_free() blocks until those ports are actually clear — called both at\n  clean-slate and immediately before launching the backends.\n- e2e pass/fail is now the cypress EXIT CODE, not log-grepping (the old accounting\n  reported a pass while exit was 1).\n- removed the whole-suite retry: a true one-shot must pass in one attempt; a retry\n  only masked the crashed-gateway regression.\n\nValidated: `sh run-all-tests.sh --skip-backend --skip-frontend` → ALL GREEN, exit 0,\nstore 18/18 on the FIRST attempt (gateway 11, blog 150, store 18).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7da366c6fe70297cc4a2c67ccbe443e657d2c372","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/git/trees/7da366c6fe70297cc4a2c67ccbe443e657d2c372"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/git/commits/ea9fbc8b2af3bb1deb3135f22856680fcd8e2ff0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login