 true }` to every `<field>-add-toggle` and\n  `dialog-edit-toggle` click — Material slide-toggle host clicks don''t\n  propagate.\n- Append `, { force: true }` to MAP<DAYJS> date-input typing — mat-label\n  covers the input until first focus.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"da4497382824321601ab5e24653b515a3251e6df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/git/trees/da4497382824321601ab5e24653b515a3251e6df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/git/commits/83169f0ae63c7895d32b88cdfb91d21ac9efb686","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/commit/83169f0ae63c7895d32b88cdfb91d21ac9efb686","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyDr9oAKDgzMTY5ZjBhZTYzYzc4OTVkMzJiODhjZGZiOTFkMjFhYzllZmI2ODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/commit/8422d067e534de499281bbb3f88442a677ed3f4d","sha":"8422d067e534de499281bbb3f88442a677ed3f4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/commits/8422d067e534de499281bbb3f88442a677ed3f4d"}],"sha":"83169f0ae63c7895d32b88cdfb91d21ac9efb686","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/commits/83169f0ae63c7895d32b88cdfb91d21ac9efb686"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/commits/8422d067e534de499281bbb3f88442a677ed3f4d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T22:39:35Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T22:39:35Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"docs: prefix .\\ on Windows commands for PowerShell\n\nPowerShell''s default execution policy refuses to auto-run executables from\nthe current directory — bare `mvnw.cmd`, `compile-saathratri-dev.bat`, and\n`saathratri-generate-code-dev-cassandra.bat` all error with\n\"The term ''...'' is not recognized as the name of a cmdlet\". Prefixing `.\\`\nfixes the lookup.\n\nAlso quote `-D` properties with dots (\"-Dskip.npm\") to stop PowerShell\nparsing `.npm` as a member-access token, and add a brief PowerShell-quirk\nnote at the end of the Windows-helper block pointing at the stop-parsing\ntoken (`--%`) as an alternative.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a6fbe34aa7aa94df5bd14b3cfe7a9e7c470800a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/git/trees/a6fbe34aa7aa94df5bd14b3cfe7a9e7c470800a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/git/commits/8422d067e534de499281bbb3f88442a677ed3f4d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/commit/8422d067e534de499281bbb3f8844