ities (band-aid)\n\nMirrors the blueprint commit (a2d5b81 in generator-jhipster-cassandra):\n  - Widget templates get `<field>-row-<key|i>-{edit,delete}` hooks on each row,\n    and edit dialogs get `dialog-save-button` / `dialog-edit-value` /\n    `dialog-edit-toggle` hooks.\n  - map-dayjs Add row binds `[fieldName]=\"fieldName + ''-add-datetime''\"` on its\n    nested <app-date-time> so sub-inputs are addressable.\n  - Cypress specs (5 entities) gain `should edit a row in the <field> widget\n    via dialog` and `should delete a row in the <field> widget` per widget\n    instance (SET, MAP<TEXT>, MAP<DECIMAL>, MAP<BOOLEAN>).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9d0d70631c2166a6e82d1fba6a21fef91a96643","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/git/trees/c9d0d70631c2166a6e82d1fba6a21fef91a96643"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/git/commits/3d182e50e517c252b82cbdc50afeaf9cd115e629","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/am