s://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/commits/37f2d61d401900bb642dcd260b94979d940db4a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T18:49:02Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T18:49:02Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"feat(cypress): widget data-cy hooks + smoke tests for SET/MAP (band-aid)\n\nMirrors generator-jhipster-cassandra d750957 in the example apps:\n\n- 10 widget components (5 in cassandrablog + 5 in cassandrastore): add\n  `@Input() fieldName: string = '''';` and `[attr.data-cy]` bindings on\n  Add-row inputs and the Add button. Per widget:\n    SET<TEXT>:   -add-value, -add-button\n    MAP<TEXT>:   -add-key, -add-value, -add-button\n    MAP<DECIMAL>: -add-key, -add-value, -add-button\n    MAP<BOOLEAN>: -add-key, -add-toggle, -add-button\n    MAP<DAYJS>:  -add-key, -add-datetime, -add-button\n\n- 5 entity update.html files (AddOnsAvailable/Selected, LandingPage,\n  SaathratriEntity3, SetEntityByOrganization): pass `fieldName=\"<name>\"`\n  to each <app-*-component> wrapper.\n\n- 5 entity .cy.ts files: append per-widget smoke tests inside the\n  `describe(''new <Entity> page'', ...)` block. Tests verify the Add-row\n  hooks accept input and the Add button is reachable.\n\nPermanent fix lives in generator-jhipster-cassandra commits:\n- ea5779e ci: Node 24 GitHub Actions\n- d750957 widget hooks + smoke test generation\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claud