ould create an instance of Post` test still uses the\nGenerate-shortcut path via app-date-time[fieldName=\"X\"] parent + Generate\nbutton click; the new smoke tests cover the underlying widget separately.\n\nPermanent fix lives in the cassandra blueprint cypress/generator.js\nPOST_WRITING_ENTITIES + cassandra-angular date-time component template.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"891ce28032e8ca87ca7dc8a52110b5e3dc09cf34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/git/trees/891ce28032e8ca87ca7dc8a52110b5e3dc09cf34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/git/commits/a04d9e79b0460f0abba8ffed35204f541f4162c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/commit/a04d9e79b0460f0abba8ffed35204f541f4162c6","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyDr9oAKGEwNGQ5ZTc5YjA0NjBmMGFiY