 UTC_DATETIME fields (addedDateTime composite-key,\npublishedDateTime optional) that render via custom <app-date-time>; the\nupstream `cy.get(''[data-cy=\"<field>\"]'').type(...)` can''t target them.\nReplace those lines with `app-date-time[fieldName=\"<field>\"]` scoped\nGenerate-button clicks.\n\nPermanent fix lives in generator-jhipster-cassandra cypress/generator.js\nPOST_WRITING_ENTITIES (c.6).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9be2978bbaa3bce8fa7778419979523c02155a7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/git/trees/9be2978bbaa3bce8fa7778419979523c02155a7b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/git/commits/b9c55f5dbb39569c3cc0820438334c9d29c7a9f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/commit/b9c55f5dbb39569c3cc0820438334c9d29c7a9f9","node_id":"C_kwDOOSyDr9oAKGI5YzU1ZjVkYmIzOTU2OWMzY2MwODIwNDM4MzM0YzlkMjljN2E5Zjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/commit/3abbffa5185234543367e44829cd53b96456ae3e","sha":"3abbffa5185234543367e44829cd53b96456ae3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/commits/3abbffa5185234543367e44829cd53b96456ae3e"}],"sha":"b9c55f5dbb39569c3cc0820438334c9d29c7a9f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/commits/b9c55f5dbb39569c3cc0820438334c9d29c7a9f9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/commits/3abbffa5185234543367e44829cd53b96456ae3e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T18:18:48Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T18:18:48Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"fix(cypress): strip MAP/SET form-fill lines from `should create an instance` (band-aid)\n\nThe cassandra blueprint''s custom MAP/SET widgets (key/value rows, toggles,\ndate pickers) don''t expose `<input data-cy=\"<fieldName>\">`, so upstream''s\n`cy.get(''[data-cy=\"<map>\"]'').type(...)` times out.\n\nPatched specs:\n- add-ons-available-by-organization.cy.ts (4 MAP fields, -9 lines)\n- add-ons-selected-by-organization.cy.ts  (4 MAP fields, -9 lines)\n- landing-page-by-organization.cy.ts      (4 MAP fields, -9 lines)\n- saathratri-entity-3.cy.ts               (1 SET field, -2 lines)\n- set-entity-by-organization.cy.ts        (1 SET field, -2 lines)\n\nPermanent fix lives in generator-jhipster-cassandra cypress/generator.js\nPOST_WRITING_ENTITIES.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7723c9fadfe37e187d2376505c1c106868819bb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/git/trees/7723c9fadfe37e187d2376505c1c106868819bb3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/jhipster-cassandra-example/git/commits/3abbffa5185234543367e44829cd53b96456ae3e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred