mit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T07:50:44Z","email":"dpqls0625@naver.com","name":"sinyebin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:54:30Z","email":"76608088+sinyebin@users.noreply.github.com","name":"sinyebin"},"message":"[MM-70402] Fix Channel Settings showing unsaved changes on open for channels with untidy stored text (#38115)\n\nhasUnsavedChanges 통합에서 제외한 Managed Categories(69fbaece) 비교 두 줄을 뺐다. 우리\nhandleSave의 저장 후 fallback을 ''''에서 저장값으로 고쳐 새 테스트를 통과시켰고, 제외한\nDM/GM 설정 계보(3c792a05) 픽스처를 쓰는 DM 헤더 테스트 1개는 버렸다. Playwright\npage object는 우리 placeholder에 맞춰 purpose도 접두 정규식으로 찾는다. 상세는\ndocs/upstream-adapted-divergences.md.\n\n(cherry picked from commit 9b4ab46cc200e8e07fbec8475d2354dce5fcff60, adapted for okrbest)\nUpstream: https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/commit/9b4ab46cc200e8e07fbec8475d2354dce5fcff60\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cf681d9c89c4ac0ef4b4a35e601722909dabac2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/trees/cf681d9c89c4ac0ef4b4a35e601722909dabac2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/commits/f523ae97f4f1b7bb2c2d42393e7ef789a78ff3c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76608088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sinyebin","id":76608088,"login":"sinyebin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NjA4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/repos","site_admin":false,"starre