:0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:54:30Z","email":"76608088+sinyebin@users.noreply.github.com","name":"sinyebin"},"message":"[MM-70389] Add Android to the user_agent_platform session attribute values (#38059)\n\n일반 함수 getPlatformName의 Android 판별과 그 테스트 기대값만 받았다. 로그인 세션\nplatform 속성도 Android로 기록된다. Session Attributes 스키마(model/session_attributes.go)와\nSA·마이그레이션 테스트, 스키마를 참조하는 drift guard 테스트는 제외한 684ddb32(#36934) 계보라\n버렸다. 상세는 docs/upstream-adapted-divergences.md.\n\n(cherry picked from commit 5d5d4e27523ed2d7a1fe4ea31210b173414e6d2d, adapted for okrbest)\nUpstream: https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/commit/5d5d4e27523ed2d7a1fe4ea31210b173414e6d2d\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"722a43f740e2970b781501aa9b7c5fadae113f28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/trees/722a43f740e2970b781501aa9b7c5fadae113f28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/commits/a6279bf90de37997fa8b0855285d1fa6fd20cfd2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76608088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sinyebin","id":76608088,"login":"sinyebin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NjA4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://