users.noreply.github.com","name":"sinyebin"},"message":"[MM-70387] Keep App Marketplace modal at a fixed width when paging (#38057)\n\nThe centered GenericModal layout makes `.modal-content` a flex item of\n`.modal-dialog`. With the default `min-width: auto`, its automatic minimum\nsize grew to the min-content width of the widest `white-space: nowrap` plugin\ndescription, so `.modal-content` overflowed the 832px dialog on pages holding\nlong descriptions and snapped back on pages without them.\n\nSetting `min-width: 0` lets `.modal-content` shrink to the dialog width, so the\nmodal stays 832px on every page and long descriptions truncate with an ellipsis\ninside the list as designed.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n(cherry picked from commit 2c9524e382a4a50cb5c2cd37cc6082586a7bb00b)\n\nUpstream: https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/commit/2c9524e382a4a50cb5c2cd37cc6082586a7bb00b","tree":{"sha":"4924304a0a75b3ed7742e40f1b2a186ec12c4272","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/trees/4924304a0a75b3ed7742e40f1b2a186ec12c4272"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/commits/c5cdb5497dc45ed0b453abad9056ed9cdf6eb87f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76608088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sinyebin","id":76608088,"login":"sinyebin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NjA4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/okrbest/okrbest/commit/c5cdb5497dc45ed0b453abad9056ed9cdf6eb87f","node_id":"C_kwDOOUH-iNoAKGM1Y2RiNTQ5N2RjNDVlZDBiNDUzYWJhZDkwNTZlZDljZGY2ZWI4N2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/okrbest/okrbest/commit/65f75e169c1ba8b0beb3221b9ee976a0766c5c82","sha":"65f75e169c1ba8b0beb3221b9ee976a0766c5c82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/65f75e169c1ba8b0beb3221b9ee976a0766c5c82"}],"sha":"c5cdb5497dc45ed0b453abad9056ed9cdf6eb87f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/c5cdb5497dc45ed0b453abad9056ed9cdf6eb87f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1210556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/cursor","id":206951365,"login":"cursor[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDODFXTxQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/65f75e169c1ba8b0beb3221b9ee976a0766c5c82/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T15:51:48Z","email":"206951365+cursor[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"cursor[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:54:30Z","email":"76608088+sinyebin@users.noreply.github.com","name":"sinyebin"},"message":"[MM-63635] Fix plugin RHS panels not opening from the App Bar in the Threads view (#38116)\n\n* MM-63635 Allow plugin RHS panels to open from the App Bar in the Threads view\n\nThe Threads view dispatches selectLhsItem(Page), which clears the current\nchannel. The App Bar click handler only invoked a plugin''s action when both a\nchannel and a channel membership were present, unless the component carried an\nrhsComponentId. Plugins registered through registerChannelHeaderButtonAction\n(Copilot among them) have no rhsComponentId, so their App Bar icon did nothing\nat all outside of a channel.\n\nInvoke the action regardless of channel context, and widen the action types to\nreflect that the App Bar can call them without a channel.\n\nAlso exempt plugin RHS panels from the suppression that the Threads view\napplies on mount, so an open plugin panel survives the switch instead of being\nforce-closed and left in a state where the next App Bar click toggles it off.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* MM-63635 Add tests for opening plugin RHS panels from the Threads view\n\nCovers the App Bar invoking a plugin action with and without a channel in\ncontext, for plugins registered through both registerChannelHeaderButtonAction\nand registerAppBarComponent, asserting the RHS actually opens in the store.\nAlso covers which RHS states the Threads view suppresses on mount.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* MM-63635 Strengthen the plugin RHS tests after review\n\nAssert the plugin action''s channel arguments explicitly, add the case where the\nApp Bar is clicked while the RHS is suppressed, cover the Threads view mount\neffect clearing the current channel, and add an end-to-end case that clicks the\nApp Bar icon while the Threads view is mounted.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* MM-63635 Use a realistic App Bar icon fixture in the plugin component tests\n\nregisterAppBarComponent always supplies an iconUrl, so the fixture rendered\nmarkup production never produces. Give it a URL and assert the active state on\nthe markup each registration style actually renders.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* MM-63635 Trim narration comments from the plugin RHS change\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n(cherry picked from commit 2ee9804f99ca975b5df839346c46e89535379812)\n\nUpstream: https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/commit/2ee9804f99ca975b5df839346c46e89535379812","tree":{"sha":"0e1d3a8cccaaa5703e7223f6d9ad5e4c89844be0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/trees/0e1d3a8cccaaa5703e7223f6d9ad5e4c89844be0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/commits/65f75e169c1ba8b0beb3221b9ee976a0766c5c82","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76608088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sinyebin","id":76608088,"login":"sinyebin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NjA4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/received_events","repos_url"