anizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/9248c16bdbb0c856d911a7a6e53e9f77cae21090/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T03:05:37Z","email":"sdh485@gmail.com","name":"ux-builder"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T03:44:28Z","email":"sdh485@gmail.com","name":"ux-builder"},"message":"fix(webapp): 플러그인 전역에 StyledComponents 노출 (Playbooks 로드 수정)\n\nPlaybooks 플러그인 번들은 webpack externals로 window.StyledComponents를\n참조하는데 이 포크의 plugins/export.ts에 노출이 빠져 있어, 플러그인\n활성화 시 ReferenceError로 웹앱 전체가 빈 화면이 됐다. upstream 본체가\n노출하는 전역이므로 동일하게 추가한다.\n\n검증: playbooks 0.0.0+755bf25a 빌드·설치 후 레일에 Playbooks 버튼\n(아이콘+라벨) 생성, 1클릭 이동·활성 강조, 제품 화면에서 레일·팀 버튼\n유지, Playbooks 안 팀 전환이 제품에 머문 채 동작함을 브라우저로 실측.\nexport.test.ts 통과, eslint 0 errors, check-types 기준선 31건 동일.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7e69d61f24f011f1a1792d473b535e669b99d3cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/trees/7e69d61f24f011f1a1792d473b535e669b99d3cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/commits/9248c16bdbb0c856d911a7a6e53e9f77cae21090","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20636813?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ux-builder","id":20636813,"login":"ux-builder","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjM2ODEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/okrbest/okrbest/commit/9248c16bdbb0c856d911a7a6e53e9f77cae21090","node_id":"C_kwDOOUH-iNoAKDkyNDhjMTZiZGJiMGM4NTZkOTExYTdhNmU1M2U5Zjc3Y2FlMjEwOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/okrbest/okrbest/commit/f95ba5a8d77a3b63573b7ca533cdc50310d7cb34","sha":"f95ba5a8d77a3b63573b7ca533cdc50310d7cb34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/f95ba5a8d77a3b63573b7ca533cdc50310d7cb34"}],"sha":"9248c16bdbb0c856d911a7a6e53e9f77cae21090","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/9248c16bdbb0c856d911a7a6e53e9f77cae21090"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20636813?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ux-builder","id":20636813,"login":"ux-builder","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjM2ODEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/f95ba5a8d77a3b63573b7ca533cdc50310d7cb34/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T01:47:17Z","email":"sdh485@gmail.com","name":"ux-builder"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T03:44:28Z","email":"sdh485@gmail.com","name":"ux-builder"},"message":"feat: 좌측 네비게이션 Slack식 재구성 (기능 버튼 레일 + 팀 드롭다운)\n\n팀 레일을 Slack식 기능 버튼 레일로 바꾼다 — 상단 현재 팀 버튼(팀 전환\n드롭다운), 그 아래 Channels·Boards·Playbooks 제품 버튼(아이콘+라벨,\n활성 강조, 1클릭 이동). 팀 전환은 팀명 드롭다운과 레일 팀 버튼이 공유하는\n\"내 팀\" 목록으로 옮기고, 상단 product switcher를 제거하며 그 관리\n메뉴(시스템 콘솔·통합·사용자 그룹·마켓플레이스·정보)를 팀명 드롭다운\n하단으로 노출 조건째 이전한다. 플러그인 저장소 수정 없음 — 레일 버튼은\nregisterProduct 등록값(ProductComponent)만 사용한다.\n\n- team_sidebar: 팀 버튼 나열·드래그 정렬 제거, RailTeamButton·\n  RailProductButton 신설, peek·프로필 버튼·플러그인 슬롯 유지\n- widgets/team_list_menu: 공용 \"내 팀\" 메뉴 신설 — 제품 화면에서는\n  useCurrentProduct()로 팀 객체를 넘겨 제품에 머문 채 전환(Boards 실측)\n- sidebar_team_menu: 내 팀 섹션 + 이전된 관리 섹션, 클라우드 요금제 전용\n  부속(RestrictedIndicator 등)은 셀프호스트 포크에서 미사용이라 미이식\n- product_menu 디렉터리·상태(actions/selectors/reducers)·테스트 삭제,\n  온보딩 \"시스템 콘솔 방문\" 과제는 콘솔 직접 이동+완료 처리로 재배선\n- i18n: 신규 키 3종 en/ko 동시 추가, i18n-extract로 en.json 정합화\n  (upstream sync 잔재 드리프트 포함 — 신규 en 키 2건의 ko 번역은 별도 작업)\n- .gitignore: .playwright-mcp/ 추가 (이전 작업에서 대기)\n\n검증: TDD(테스트 7종 선행 실패 확인), 게이트 기준선 diff 클린\n(check-types 31건 동일, 접촉 jest 55/55, eslint 0 errors,\ni18n-extract:check 통과), quickstart 종단 실주행(Boards 포함) 통과.\n기록: specs/017-slack-nav-rail/tasks.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"71ddf3f5298f755d1043d1052ee199222583dc9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/trees/71ddf3f5298f755d1043d1052ee199222583dc9a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/commits