옮기고\nAllowedThemes 유효 이름에 slate를 추가했다. EnableTutorial 문구의 OKR.BEST\n리브랜드를 보존하고, ko.json 번역 16개를 새 admin.customization.* id로 옮겼다.\n삭제된 docs/main 변경은 반영하지 않았다.\n\n(cherry picked from commit 95cabdfb3b1380b44ca18e7878244f99fb19d2e5, adapted for okrbest)\nUpstream: https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/commit/95cabdfb3b1380b44ca18e7878244f99fb19d2e5\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3ea2ea28fe899288cc9f31c1db0aef2b066e7c1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/trees/3ea2ea28fe899288cc9f31c1db0aef2b066e7c1a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/commits/e76e91fb76da8439f707ce4b752bd00591244a02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76608088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sinyebin","id":76608088,"login":"sinyebin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NjA4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/okrbest/okrbest/commit/e76e91fb76da8439f707ce4b752bd00591244a02","node_id":"C_kwDOOUH-iNoAKGU3NmU5MWZiNzZkYTg0MzlmNzA3Y2U0Yjc1MmJkMDA1OTEyNDRhMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/okrbest/okrbest/commit/f35a1449a9dee798d5ffb85fb02a45d4dd0c1480","sha":"f35a1449a9dee798d5ffb85fb02a45d4dd0c1480","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/f35a1449a9dee798d5ffb85fb02a45d4dd0c1480"}],"sha":"e76e91fb76da8439f707ce4b752bd00591244a02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/e76e91fb76da8439f707ce4b752bd00591244a02"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20636813?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ux-builder","id":20636813,"login":"ux-builder","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjM2ODEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/f35a1449a9dee798d5ffb85fb02a45d4dd0c1480/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T00:47:36Z","email":"sdh485@gmail.com","name":"ux-builder"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T00:49:00Z","email":"sdh485@gmail.com","name":"ux-builder"},"message":"feat: 시스템 관리자 테마 전체 적용 기능 추가\n\n화면 설정 > 테마에 시스템 관리자 전용 \"모든 팀원에게 새로운 테마를\n적용합니다\" 체크박스를 추가한다. 체크 후 저장하면 서버가 모든 활성\n사용자(봇·비활성 제외)의 테마를 단일 트랜잭션으로 덮어쓰고, 팀별 테마를\n정리하며, 브로드캐스트 웹소켓 이벤트로 접속 중 화면에 즉시 반영한다.\n일회성 적용이라 이후 각 사용자는 자기 테마를 자유롭게 바꿀 수 있다.\n\n- server: PreferenceStore.ApplyThemeToAllUsers (DELETE+INSERT...SELECT...ON\n  CONFLICT 단일 트랜잭션), app.ApplyThemeToAllUsers (원본 IsValid 검증 후\n  PreUpdate 정제, theme_applied_to_all 브로드캐스트), POST\n  /api/v4/users/theme/apply_to_all (manage_system 강제, audit 기록),\n  Client4 메서드, store mock·retry/timer 레이어 재생성, i18n en/ko\n- webapp: 관리자 전용 체크박스(체크 시 기존 \"모든 팀\" 체크박스 켜짐+비활성),\n  applyThemeToAllUsers 액션·client4 메서드, theme_applied_to_all 수신\n  핸들러(팀별 테마 제거+전역 테마 갱신), i18n en/ko\n- api: preferences.yaml에 엔드포인트 문서 추가\n- specs/016-admin-theme-apply: spec/plan/tasks/research/data-model/contracts/\n  quickstart + 기준선·RED/GREEN 증거·검증 결과 기록\n\n검증: storetest/app/api4/jest 테스트 전부 구현 전 실패 확인 후 통과,\n게이트 기준선 diff 클린, quickstart 5개 시나리오 실환경 통과\n(1,026명 적용 8.1ms, 접속 세션 반영 33ms, 비관리자 403).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b1252fa090d6e046f2270d09359e6e6802c628a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/trees/b1252fa090d6e046f2270d09359e6e6802c628a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/commits/f35a1449a9dee798d5ffb85fb02a45d4dd0c1480","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20636813?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ux-builder","id":20636813,"login":"ux-builder","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjM2ODEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ux-builder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https: