/sinyebin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/c0d28abeb3fa295d213898c50cc282d0add32137/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:44:13Z","email":"dpqls0625@naver.com","name":"sinyebin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:37:25Z","email":"76608088+sinyebin@users.noreply.github.com","name":"sinyebin"},"message":"Data spillage exposure radius report generation (#37809)\n\nokrbest: 기능 전체를 받고, 제외한 개명 계보(f1b9aa05)에 걸린 네 곳을 우리\n용어로 바꿨다 — CheckFlaggedPostActionable 에러 id를 api.content_flagging.*로,\n검토자 알림·신규 테스트의 \"quarantined\"를 \"flagged\"로. en.json은 이 커밋의\n신규 키만 골라 받았다(server 29, webapp 4). store layers·mocks 재생성 diff 0.\n차이는 docs/upstream-adapted-divergences.md에 기록.\n\n(cherry picked from commit fb87397dbaeacf2578ab5f9ab69a0ee3860f9e80, adapted for okrbest)\nUpstream: https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/commit/fb87397dbaeacf2578ab5f9ab69a0ee3860f9e80\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8c491a32737b6109689c353c8d2d3aa49783c91f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/trees/8c491a32737b6109689c353c8d2d3aa49783c91f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/commits/c0d28abeb3fa295d213898c50cc282d0add32137","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76608088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sinyebin","id":76608088,"login":"sinyebin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NjA4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/okrbest/okrbest/commit/c0d28abeb3fa295d213898c50cc282d0add32137","node_id":"C_kwDOOUH-iNoAKGMwZDI4YWJlYjNmYTI5NWQyMTM4OThjNTBjYzI4MmQwYWRkMzIxMzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/okrbest/okrbest/commit/81849843e8608d9aa795e3f83ae4b9f982251814","sha":"81849843e8608d9aa795e3f83ae4b9f982251814","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/81849843e8608d9aa795e3f83ae4b9f982251814"}],"sha":"c0d28abeb3fa295d213898c50cc282d0add32137","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/c0d28abeb3fa295d213898c50cc282d0add32137"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1210556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/cursor","id":206951365,"login":"cursor[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDODFXTxQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/81849843e8608d9aa795e3f83ae4b9f982251814/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T07:05:10Z","email":"206951365+cursor[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"cursor[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:37:25Z","email":"76608088+sinyebin@users.noreply.github.com","name":"sinyebin"},"message":"[MM-70252] Return 400 for malformed date filters in logs query API (#37970)\n\n* [MM-70252] Reject malformed date filters in logs query API\n\nThe POST /api/v4/logs/query endpoint parsed date_from/date_to with a fixed\nlayout and swallowed parse errors, silently dropping the bound instead of\nsignalling the caller. A malformed date_from became the zero time and a\nmalformed date_to became now, so the request returned HTTP 200 with an\nunfiltered result set.\n\nAdd LogFilter.IsValid, which rejects a non-empty bound that cannot be parsed\nwith the shared LogFilterDateLayout while keeping empty strings meaning\n\"unbounded\", and call it from queryLogs so a bad filter returns 400 naming the\noffending field and the expected layout.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* [MM-70252] Add tests for logs query date filter validation\n\nAdd a unit test for LogFilter.IsValid covering empty (unbounded), valid, and\nmalformed bounds, and an api4 integration test that drives POST /logs/query\nthrough the real router to assert malformed date_from/date_to return 400 with\nthe offending field id while empty and valid bounds return 200.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* [MM-70252] Harden logs query date filter tests\n\nAddress test-quality review: exercise the DateTo validation branch with a valid\nnon-empty DateFrom, move fallible checks out of the require.Eventually condition\nto avoid a cross-goroutine failure, and make each api4 subtest self-contained by\npolling for the expected messages via a shared helper so valid-bounds also\nverifies filtering still returns records.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* [MM-70252] Retrigger CI/CodeRabbit after invalid public-module feedback\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* [MM-70252] Note shared LogFilterDateLayout usage in date filter\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* [MM-70252] Add Client4.QueryLogs to simplify logs query date filter tests\n\n* Address PR feedback: 2 answered, 1 resolved, 0 declined\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\nCo-authored-by: Ben Schumacher <ben.schumacher@mattermost.com>\n(cherry picked from commit 6941f569018775c17062ab1118c6df84386a28ad)\n\nUpstream: https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/commit/6941f569018775c17062ab1118c6df84386a28ad","tree":{"sha":"f14061332b326abade5b125e7b8bd4baa45a9be2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/trees/f14061332b326abade5b125e7b8bd4baa45a9be2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/commits/81849843e8608d9aa795e3f83ae4b9f982251814","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76608088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sinyebin","id":76608088,"login":"sinyebin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NjA4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscr