ps://api.github.com/users/jwilander","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/9aad06fb64549e4ec5628da9c87de183da1b92b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T23:45:09Z","email":"jwawilander@gmail.com","name":"Joram Wilander"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T06:32:59Z","email":"76608088+sinyebin@users.noreply.github.com","name":"sinyebin"},"message":"Keep a collapse toggle for single video attachments (#38012)\n\nMediaGallery hid its header for single tiles, so a collapsed video\ndisappeared with no way to expand it.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n(cherry picked from commit 6d78e8d55189626ac765d4504dfca61d430b8490)\n\nUpstream: https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/commit/6d78e8d55189626ac765d4504dfca61d430b8490","tree":{"sha":"19983e92b7bc85c017156358f69cefa9afc5fdbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/trees/19983e92b7bc85c017156358f69cefa9afc5fdbc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/commits/9aad06fb64549e4ec5628da9c87de183da1b92b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76608088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sinyebin","id":76608088,"login":"sinyebin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NjA4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/okrbest/okrbest/commit/9aad06fb64549e4ec5628da9c87de183da1b92b5","node_id":"C_kwDOOUH-iNoAKDlhYWQwNmZiNjQ1NDllNGVjNTYyOGRhOWM4N2RlMTgzZGExYjkyYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/okrbest/okrbest/commit/5dfbd1f9a09eae217020464d9db5d30825abee8d","sha":"5dfbd1f9a09eae217020464d9db5d30825abee8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/5dfbd1f9a09eae217020464d9db5d30825abee8d"}],"sha":"9aad06fb64549e4ec5628da9c87de183da1b92b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/9aad06fb64549e4ec5628da9c87de183da1b92b5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1210556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/cursor","id":206951365,"login":"cursor[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDODFXTxQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/5dfbd1f9a09eae217020464d9db5d30825abee8d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T12:10:26Z","email":"206951365+cursor[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"cursor[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T06:32:59Z","email":"76608088+sinyebin@users.noreply.github.com","name":"sinyebin"},"message":"Allow granting delegated administration roles from the Manage Roles modal (#37202)\n\n* Add delegated administration roles to Manage Roles modal\n\nAllow admins to grant custom (delegated granular administration) roles\ndirectly from the System Console > Users > Manage Roles modal, instead of\nonly via Delegated Granular Administration.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Add tests for delegated administration roles in Manage Roles modal\n\nCover rendering, pre-checking, availability filtering, bot handling,\nmerge/remove on save, ordering, admin/member toggling, save errors,\nmodal close, and user-switch state reset.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Fix lint in manage roles modal test\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Address PR feedback: link to system roles page and refine delegated roles spacing\n\n- Replace per-role subtext with a single help-text link to the System Roles\n  page, since customized roles can differ from the default descriptions\n- Add padding below the radio buttons above the divider\n- Left-align the delegated roles section with the section above and add\n  padding below the divider\n\n* Address PR feedback: license-gate delegated roles, refine help text, dedupe SCSS\n\n* Assert delegated roles help text and link in modal tests\n\n* Address PR feedback: gate delegated roles by Enterprise license (exclude Entry), hide for system admins, add Personal Access Tokens section heading\n\n* Add e2e tests for delegated admin roles in Manage Roles modal\n\n* Drop unused radio locator from ManageRolesModal page object\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mattermost Build <build@mattermost.com>\n(cherry picked from commit fd62fe4faacf03845d9f723eeacba8798226587d)\n\nUpstream: https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/commit/fd62fe4faacf03845d9f723eeacba8798226587d","tree":{"sha":"866cb1d8ce5a3e5be06c1ce15f121b9cb0fda4f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/trees/866cb1d8ce5a3e5be06c1ce15f121b9cb0fda4f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/commits/5dfbd1f9a09eae217020464d9db5d30825abee8d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76608088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sinyebin","id":76608088,"login":"sinyebin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NjA4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/okrbest/okrbest/commit/5dfbd1f9a09eae217020464d9db5d30825abee8d","node_id":"C_kwDOOUH-iNoAKDVkZmJkMWY5YTA5ZWFlMjE3MDIwNDY0ZDlkYjVkMzA4MjVhYmVlOGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/okrbest/okrbest/commit/9f67c7d2fd4053dbf3e78d61ca9c0eb52dfbba9d","sha":"9f67c7d2fd4053dbf3e78d61ca9c0eb52dfbba9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/9f67c7d2fd4053dbf3e78d61ca9c0eb52dfbba9d"}],"sha":"5dfbd1f9a09eae217020464d9db5d30825abee8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/5dfbd1f9a09eae217020464d9db5d30825abee8d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1210556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/cursor","id":206951365,"login":"cursor[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDODFXTxQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/9f67c7d2fd4053dbf3e78d61ca9c0eb52dfbba9d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T12:07:37Z","email":"206951365+cursor[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"cursor[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T06:32:59Z","email":"76608088+sinyebin@users.noreply.github.com","name":"sinyebin"},"message":"[MM-70283] Fix mixed custom-section fallback hiding valid plugin settings (#38004)\n\n* [MM-70283] Fix mixed custom-section fallback hiding valid fallback settings\n\nWhen a disabled plugin defined multiple custom settings sections and only\nsome specified fallback: true, the settings page collapsed every section\ninto a single \"enable the plugin\" warning, hiding the fallback-enabled\nsections that should remain configurable.\n\nThe collapse now only happens when no custom section allows a fallback.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* [MM-70283] Add test for mixed custom-section fallback\n\nCovers a disabled plugin with mixed fallback sections: the fallback-enabled\nsection stays configurable, the non-fallback section shows a per-section\nwarning, and the single collapse warning is not rendered.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* [MM-70283] Improve mixed custom-section fallback tests\n\nRename the visibility test to match its assertions, add an\norder-independent case, and assert non-fallback section settings are\nsuppressed.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* [MM-70283] Tighten fallback comment wording\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n(cherry picked from commit 3f02a0a1ac705d9900cbea8f82cb10df7e37b3ce)\n\nUpstream: https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/commit/3f02a0a1ac705d9900cbea8f82cb10df7e37b3ce","tree":{"sha":"5082034031cf065a469b99c3a83959bc44a1f227","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/trees/5082034031cf065a469b99c3a83959bc44a1f227"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/commits/9f67c7d2fd4053dbf3e78d61ca9c0eb52dfbba9d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76608088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sinyebin","id":76608088,"login":"sinyebin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NjA4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/okrbest/okrbest/commit/9f67c7d2fd4053dbf3e78d61ca9c0eb52dfbba9d","node_id":"C_kwDOOUH-iNoAKDlmNjdjN2QyZmQ0MDUzZGJmM2U3OGQ2MWNhOWMwZWI1MmRmYmJhOWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/okrbest/okrbest/commit/1fc4a7a6d7e234a07fd210f02202b9050696dbd7","sha":"1fc4a7a6d7e234a07fd210f02202b9050696dbd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/1fc4a7a6d7e234a07fd210f02202b9050696dbd7"}],"sha":"9f67c7d2fd4053dbf3e78d61ca9c0eb52dfbba9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/9f67c7d2fd4053dbf3e78d61ca9c0eb52dfbba9d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16541325?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hanzei","id":16541325,"login":"hanzei","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTQxMzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/1fc4a7a6d7e234a07fd210f02202b9050696dbd7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T10:11:17Z","email":"ben.schumacher@mattermost.com","name":"Ben Schumacher"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T06:32:59Z","email":"76608088+sinyebin@users.noreply.github.com","name":"sinyebin"},"message":"MM-67868: Remove deprecated Slack compatibility type aliases (#37163)\n\nRemove the deprecated backward-compatibility aliases introduced in #35445:\nSlackAttachment, SlackAttachmentField, ParseSlackAttachment, and\nStringifySlackFieldValue. Plugins should now use the MessageAttachment\nequivalents directly.\n\nSlackCompatibleBool is retained as it is still actively used.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KnMUsaSbm4HQsNEEtH5zp8\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mattermost Build <build@mattermost.com>\n(cherry picked from commit 2b40a0bdaeb80e022dab022c3ef352ec170881a2)\n\nUpstream: https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/commit/2b40a0bdaeb80e022dab022c3ef352ec170881a2","tree":{"sha":"df8da99480862c9b6f57052341b7c5f432917cc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/trees/df8da99480862c9b6f57052341b7c5f432917cc6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/commits/1fc4a7a6d7e234a07fd210f02202b9050696dbd7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76608088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sinyebin","id":76608088,"login":"sinyebin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NjA4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/okrbest/okrbest/commit/1fc4a7a6d7e234a07fd210f02202b9050696dbd7","node_id":"C_kwDOOUH-iNoAKDFmYzRhN2E2ZDdlMjM0YTA3ZmQyMTBmMDIyMDJiOTA1MDY5NmRiZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/okrbest/okrbest/commit/9cf7de548362bc90787bd5bc79965fc099cade8f","sha":"9cf7de548362bc90787bd5bc79965fc099cade8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/9cf7de548362bc90787bd5bc79965fc099cade8f"}],"sha":"1fc4a7a6d7e234a07fd210f02202b9050696dbd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/1fc4a7a6d7e234a07fd210f02202b9050696dbd7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16541325?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hanzei","id":16541325,"login":"hanzei","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTQxMzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanzei","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/9cf7de548362bc90787bd5bc79965fc099cade8f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T06:43:18Z","email":"ben.schumacher@mattermost.com","name":"Ben Schumacher"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T06:32:59Z","email":"76608088+sinyebin@users.noreply.github.com","name":"sinyebin"},"message":"[MM-67157] Remove format parameter requirement from client license endpoint (#37167)\n\n* MM-67157: Remove unused format flag from /license/client endpoint\n\nThe `format` query parameter on the `/license/client` (and local\nvariant) endpoint was effectively dead: it was required but only ever\naccepted the single value `old`, returning an error otherwise. This\nmirrors the earlier removal of the same flag from `/config/client`,\nwhere the server now ignores the parameter while clients continue to\nsend `format=old` for compatibility with pre-v11 servers.\n\nThe server no longer inspects the `format` parameter, so requests with\nno format, `format=old`, or any other value all succeed. The unused\ni18n string and the parameter/response documentation in the OpenAPI\nspec are removed accordingly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Audz4JLNQN5SJxcPwyQBd\n\n* MM-67157: document format=old retention in webapp client\n\nMirror the getClientConfig comment so the format=old query param on\ngetClientLicenseOld is not mistakenly removed; clients keep sending it\nfor compatibility with pre-v11 servers even though current servers now\nignore it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Audz4JLNQN5SJxcPwyQBd\n\n* MM-67157: stop sending format=old from webapp client\n\nNow that the server ignores the format parameter on /license/client,\ndrop format=old from the @mattermost/client getClientLicenseOld call and\nupdate the e2e intercepts/helpers that matched the old query string.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Audz4JLNQN5SJxcPwyQBd\n\n* Drop unneeded wildcard from license/client cy.intercept path\n\nThe format query param is gone from GET /license/client requests, so\nthe trailing * used to match it is no longer needed.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n(cherry picked from commit ea183fab48b833461d83af94c21cdc62eaef3d2d)\n\nUpstream: https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/commit/ea183fab48b833461d83af94c21cdc62eaef3d2d","tree":{"sha":"06caac1c1afd771caac9c3b7ee469c366d9d33a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/trees/06caac1c1afd771caac9c3b7ee469c366d9d33a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/commits/9cf7de548362bc90787bd5bc79965fc099cade8f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76608088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sinyebin","id":76608088,"login":"sinyebin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NjA4MDg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinyebin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/okrbest/okrbest/commit/9cf7de548362bc90787bd5bc79965fc099cade8f","node_id":"C_kwDOOUH-iNoAKDljZjdkZTU0ODM2MmJjOTA3ODdiZDViYzc5OTY1ZmMwOTljYWRlOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/okrbest/okrbest/commit/921cfb0a5ce7fc1405a