_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bgardner8008/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bgardner8008/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bgardner8008","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/commits/82ef8ca4847b310916b23b229b79d1976587648f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T07:36:17Z","email":"billg@wavearts.com","name":"Bill Gardner"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:37:30Z","email":"76608088+sinyebin@users.noreply.github.com","name":"sinyebin"},"message":"[MM-69889] Improve handling of RelayState in SAML flow (#37837)\n\n* [MM-69889] Improve handling of RelayState in SAML flow\n\nRelayState was base64-decoded and trusted without any integrity check,\nletting its contents be tampered with client-side. Sign relayProps with\nan HMAC key (generated once, cached, stored like AsymmetricSigningKey)\nbefore handing it to the IdP, and verify the signature before trusting\nany of its fields on the way back.\n\n* Add short expiry to signed RelayState\n\nBound the signed RelayState''s validity to 5 minutes to restrict the\nwindow in which a captured, unmodified RelayState could be replayed.\n\n* [MM-69889] Use maps.Copy in SignSamlRelayState\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Mattermost Build <build@mattermost.com>\n(cherry picked from commit 22eaa8b03bbe2deb4728f4cf5cd5e870b90c6539)\n\nUpstream: https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/commit/22eaa8b03bbe2deb4728f4cf5cd5e870b90c6539","tree":{"sha":"8b4861a85a45a47cf37ba21716e2f2187f4a1dd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/trees/8b4861a85a45a47cf37ba21716e2f2187f4a1dd7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrbest/git/commits/82ef8ca4847b310916b23b229b79d1976587648f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76608088?v=4","eve