eat: Initialize product listing microfrontend with basic components and configuration\n\n- Add package.json with dependencies and scripts for product listing\n- Create ProductCard component for displaying individual product details\n- Implement ProductListingPage to fetch and display products from API\n- Set up TypeScript configuration for product listing\n- Configure Webpack for building and serving product listing microfrontend\n\nfeat: Set up shell application with routing and header component\n\n- Add package.json for shell application with necessary dependencies\n- Create Header component for navigation\n- Implement AppShell to include ProductListingPage, CartPage, and UserProfilePage\n- Configure TypeScript for shell application\n- Set up Webpack for building and serving shell application with Module Federation\n\nfeat: Initialize user profile microfrontend with form handling\n\n- Add package.json for user profile microfrontend with dependencies\n- Create UserProfileForm component for user data input\n- Implement UserProfilePage to render UserProfileForm\n- Set up TypeScript configuration for user profile\n- Configure Webpack for building and serving user profile microfrontend with Module Federation","tree":{"sha":"8aa02a69d1108ceaaf2f53946e0081adda14da9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anand2165/MFE/git/trees/8aa02a69d1108ceaaf2f53946e0081adda14da9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anand2165/MFE/git/commits/c9a8c3ed89fe47ffd4f8ab72d633a020081c8b53","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/159022876?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand2165/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand2165/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand2165/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand2165/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https: